Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:03.57,ENG,2,0,0,0,,Just packed up a real money load, and it's coming your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:05.90,ENG,3,0,0,0,,Look for "Rodgers" on the side of the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:08.41,ENG,4,0,0,0,,Don't forget my share of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:03:58.22,ENG,5,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:03:58.65,ENG,6,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.68,ENG,7,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:41.69,ENG,8,0,0,0,,- Tuna on white, no crust, right? - I don't know. How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:46.15,ENG,9,0,0,0,,Every day for the last three weeks you've been coming in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:48.46,ENG,10,0,0,0,,and you've been asking me how the tuna is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:50.02,ENG,11,0,0,0,,It was crappy yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:52.36,ENG,12,0,0,0,,it was crappy the day before, and guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:55.37,ENG,13,0,0,0,,- It hasn't changed. - I'll have the tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:58.37,ENG,14,0,0,0,,- No crust? - No crust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:23.60,ENG,15,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:13.18,ENG,16,0,0,0,,Talk to me, Jesse. This ain't workir, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:16.45,ENG,17,0,0,0,,It's your fuel map. It's got a nasty hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.11,ENG,18,0,0,0,,- It's why you're unloading in third. - I told you it was third.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:22.02,ENG,19,0,0,0,,I lengthen the injector pulse another millisec...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:25.03,ENG,20,0,0,0,,and just tune the NOS timer, you'll run nines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:34.84,ENG,21,0,0,0,,What's up with this fool? What is he, sandwich crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:36.84,ENG,22,0,0,0,,No, V. He ain't here for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:39.54,ENG,23,0,0,0,,Chill out, bro. He's just slinging parts for Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:42.98,ENG,24,0,0,0,,- I know what he's slinging. - He's trying to get in Mia's pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:45.48,ENG,25,0,0,0,,- What's up, guys? - How you doing, Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:46.98,ENG,26,0,0,0,,How you livir, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:50.91,ENG,27,0,0,0,,Hey, Dom. You want something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:03.73,ENG,28,0,0,0,,Ah, he's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.39,ENG,29,0,0,0,,I like his haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:07.40,ENG,30,0,0,0,,Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:08.27,ENG,31,0,0,0,,Vince!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.93,ENG,32,0,0,0,,- What? - Can I get you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:15.68,ENG,33,0,0,0,,You look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:21.31,ENG,34,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Mia. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:22.82,ENG,35,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:29.11,ENG,36,0,0,0,,- Tomorrow? - Oh, I love this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:32.59,ENG,37,0,0,0,,Try Fatburger from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:36.06,ENG,38,0,0,0,,You can get yourself a double-cheese with fries for 2.95, faggot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:39.26,ENG,39,0,0,0,,- I like the tuna here. - Bullshit. No one likes the tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:40.89,ENG,40,0,0,0,,Well, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.91,ENG,41,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ, Dom! Would you get out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:58.61,ENG,42,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this shit! I'm not kidding, Dom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:00.45,ENG,43,0,0,0,,Get out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:06.39,ENG,44,0,0,0,,- What'd you put in that sandwich? - That's really funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.22,ENG,45,0,0,0,,Dom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:09.22,ENG,46,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:30.38,ENG,47,0,0,0,,- He was in my face. - I'm in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:34.95,ENG,48,0,0,0,,Relax! Don't push it! You embarrass me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:39.76,ENG,49,0,0,0,,Get over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.99,ENG,50,0,0,0,,Jesse, give me the wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:48.29,ENG,51,0,0,0,,"Brian Earl Spilner." Sounds like a serial killer name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:50.03,ENG,52,0,0,0,,- Is that what you are? - No, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.94,ENG,53,0,0,0,,Don't come around here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:57.34,ENG,54,0,0,0,,Hey, man, you know this is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:09:00.47,ENG,55,0,0,0,,- You work for Harry, right? - Yeah, I just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.38,ENG,56,0,0,0,,You were just fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:07.35,ENG,57,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:18.19,ENG,58,0,0,0,,Hey, Dominic, I appreciate what you did in a big way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:20.53,ENG,59,0,0,0,,Dominic, I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:25.14,ENG,60,0,0,0,,Brian, you're messing with my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:27.14,ENG,61,0,0,0,,When Dominic drives, he's golden.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:30.44,ENG,62,0,0,0,,Kids pour in here, want everything he has, every performance part...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:32.14,ENG,63,0,0,0,,and they pay cash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:35.15,ENG,64,0,0,0,,- What did Dominic say? - You don't wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:38.62,ENG,65,0,0,0,,- What did Dominic say? - He wants you outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:40.71,ENG,66,0,0,0,,- He wants me outta here? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:44.48,ENG,67,0,0,0,,- And what did you say to Dom? - What do you think I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:47.43,ENG,68,0,0,0,,I told him, "Good help is hard to find."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:51.46,ENG,69,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:56.50,ENG,70,0,0,0,,I need NOS.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:58.77,ENG,71,0,0,0,,- I need NOS. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.54,ENG,72,0,0,0,,My car topped out at 140 miles per hour this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:03.54,ENG,73,0,0,0,,Amateurs don't use nitrous oxide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.61,0:10:06.88,ENG,74,0,0,0,,I've seen the way you drive. You got a heavy foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:09.71,ENG,75,0,0,0,,- You'll blow yourself to pieces. - I need one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:11.75,ENG,76,0,0,0,,One of the big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.82,0:10:14.15,ENG,77,0,0,0,,Actually, no. Let's make it two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.76,ENG,78,0,0,0,,And, Harry, I need it by tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:17.16,ENG,79,0,0,0,,And, Harry, I need it by tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:31.09,ENG,80,0,0,0,,Hey, hold up, hold up. Look at this snowman right here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:39.10,ENG,81,0,0,0,,Sweet ride. What you running under there, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:44.17,ENG,82,0,0,0,,- Making me find out the hard way? - Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:47.81,ENG,83,0,0,0,,You brave. You brave. They call me Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:50.37,ENG,84,0,0,0,,I got a last name too, but I can't pronounce it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:51.94,ENG,85,0,0,0,,Brian Spilner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.61,ENG,86,0,0,0,,Typical white boy name. Know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.82,ENG,87,0,0,0,,See that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:02.69,ENG,88,0,0,0,,That's mine. It's my baby. But I ain't cutting her loose tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:04.82,ENG,89,0,0,0,,- Why not? - 'Cause I'm going legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:07.37,ENG,90,0,0,0,,Trying to get on the NI RA circuit. You heard about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:08.87,ENG,91,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:12.03,ENG,92,0,0,0,,- So what's up with you, man? - I'm just waiting for Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:14.54,ENG,93,0,0,0,,Shit. Better get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.61,0:12:17.70,ENG,94,0,0,0,,- This yours? - Yeah. I'm standing next to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:21.68,ENG,95,0,0,0,,That's funny. You know, Edwin happens to know a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.84,ENG,96,0,0,0,,And one of the things Edwin knows is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:26.39,ENG,97,0,0,0,,it's not how you stand by your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:28.92,ENG,98,0,0,0,,It's how you race your car. You better learn that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:37.76,ENG,99,0,0,0,,Oh, shit. Here they come. It's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:12:58.68,ENG,100,0,0,0,,- Dom, how you doing? - Hey, Camille.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:00.69,ENG,101,0,0,0,,You been doing yoga?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.75,ENG,102,0,0,0,,You did? Of course you did. Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:12.76,ENG,103,0,0,0,,I smell skanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:17.03,ENG,104,0,0,0,,Why don't you pack it up before I leave tread marks on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.64,0:13:20.90,ENG,105,0,0,0,,- Letty, I was just talking. - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:23.10,ENG,106,0,0,0,,Okay, Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:25.37,ENG,107,0,0,0,,Yeah? What's up, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:27.94,ENG,108,0,0,0,,- What's up? - Edwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:30.64,ENG,109,0,0,0,,- How we doing this tonight? - One race.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:33.41,ENG,110,0,0,0,,Two-G buy-in. Winner takes all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:36.39,ENG,111,0,0,0,,- Hector, you're gonna hold the cash. - Why Hector?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.45,ENG,112,0,0,0,,He's too slow to make away with the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:44.12,ENG,113,0,0,0,,- Good luck, guys. - Wait. Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:48.10,ENG,114,0,0,0,,I don't have any cash, but I do have the pink slip to my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:51.80,ENG,115,0,0,0,,You just can't climb in the ring with Ali 'cause you think you box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:54.77,ENG,116,0,0,0,,He knows I can box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:56.93,ENG,117,0,0,0,,So check it out. It's like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:14:00.17,ENG,118,0,0,0,,I lose, the winner takes my car, clean and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:04.01,ENG,119,0,0,0,,But if I win, I take the cash, and I take the respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.42,ENG,120,0,0,0,,Respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:09.32,ENG,121,0,0,0,,To some people, that's more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.82,ENG,122,0,0,0,,That your car?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:19.36,ENG,123,0,0,0,,I see a cool-air intake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.43,0:14:22.16,ENG,124,0,0,0,,It's got a NOS-fogger system and a T-four turbo, Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:24.36,ENG,125,0,0,0,,I see an AIC controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:27.30,ENG,126,0,0,0,,It has direct port nitrous injection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:31.21,ENG,127,0,0,0,,Yeah, and a stand-alone fuel management system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:34.66,ENG,128,0,0,0,,Not a bad way to spend $10,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.61,ENG,129,0,0,0,,You see that shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:41.84,ENG,130,0,0,0,,He's got enough NOS in there to blow himself up, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.81,ENG,131,0,0,0,,What do you say? Am I won'thy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:47.68,ENG,132,0,0,0,,We don't know yet. But you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.35,ENG,133,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:57.22,ENG,134,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:01.23,ENG,135,0,0,0,,Street's closed, pizza boy. Find another way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:02.89,ENG,136,0,0,0,,Goddamn street racers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:05.90,ENG,137,0,0,0,,Iog on 22, code three. Tension is high.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.97,0:16:07.90,ENG,138,0,0,0,,They've blocked the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.08,ENG,139,0,0,0,,Edwin...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:17:00.31,ENG,140,0,0,0,,this is yours, whether you win or lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.39,0:17:03.52,ENG,141,0,0,0,,But if you win, you get her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:14.33,ENG,142,0,0,0,,You're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:17.33,ENG,143,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:04.65,ENG,144,0,0,0,,We had a reported homicide, 187, at Barakian liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:07.78,ENG,145,0,0,0,,I've got a 187 in Glendale. Cops are all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:10.32,ENG,146,0,0,0,,We're good to roll. I repeat, good to roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.39,0:18:12.33,ENG,147,0,0,0,,- Let's race! - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:23.26,ENG,148,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:37.78,ENG,149,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.30,ENG,150,0,0,0,,Damn, that guy's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:06.60,ENG,151,0,0,0,,Let's go! "Menage A"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:36.10,ENG,152,0,0,0,,No! Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:51.18,ENG,153,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:53.16,ENG,154,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.61,0:20:49.88,ENG,155,0,0,0,,Let's go now, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.79,0:21:04.32,ENG,156,0,0,0,,- Here's what you want, right here. - There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.56,ENG,157,0,0,0,,You were racing a bunch of skateboards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.57,ENG,158,0,0,0,,My sister holds the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.07,ENG,159,0,0,0,,Count it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:17.01,ENG,160,0,0,0,,And you're my trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.81,0:21:21.80,ENG,161,0,0,0,,Hey, Monica! What's up, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:24.32,ENG,162,0,0,0,,What's your problem, nigga? You didn't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.65,0:21:28.25,ENG,163,0,0,0,,Fuck you, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:44.86,ENG,164,0,0,0,,- Was that fun? - Got a problem there, huh, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:54.60,ENG,165,0,0,0,,- What are you smiling about? - Dude, I almost had you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:59.21,ENG,166,0,0,0,,You almost had me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:02.88,ENG,167,0,0,0,,You never had me. You never had your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:08.92,ENG,168,0,0,0,,Granny shifting, not double-clutching like you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.99,0:22:13.43,ENG,169,0,0,0,,You're lucky that hundred-shot of NOS didn't blow the welds on the intake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:16.97,ENG,170,0,0,0,,Almost had me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:23.97,ENG,171,0,0,0,,Now me and the mad scientist gotta rip apart the block...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:26.88,ENG,172,0,0,0,,and replace the piston rings you fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:36.61,ENG,173,0,0,0,,Ask any racer, any real racer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.69,0:22:40.15,ENG,174,0,0,0,,It don't matter if you win by an inch or a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:42.02,ENG,175,0,0,0,,Winning's winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:52.03,ENG,176,0,0,0,,Available units, we have reported street racing along Hawthorne...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:54.33,ENG,177,0,0,0,,Oh, shit! We got cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.41,0:22:55.67,ENG,178,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:10.28,ENG,179,0,0,0,,Dom, get in the car! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.87,0:24:34.93,ENG,180,0,0,0,,Toretto, stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.96,0:24:54.79,ENG,181,0,0,0,,Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.31,0:25:44.10,ENG,182,0,0,0,,You're the last person in the world I expected to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.68,0:25:49.04,ENG,183,0,0,0,,I thought if I got in your good graces, you might let me keep my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.11,0:25:52.71,ENG,184,0,0,0,,You are in my good graces, but you ain't keeping your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.12,0:25:56.78,ENG,185,0,0,0,,You drive like you've done this before. What are you, a wheel man?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.09,0:25:58.08,ENG,186,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.76,0:26:00.69,ENG,187,0,0,0,,You boost cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.96,0:26:04.15,ENG,188,0,0,0,,- No. Never. - Ever done time?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.23,0:26:07.46,ENG,189,0,0,0,,Couple of overnighters. No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.53,0:26:10.83,ENG,190,0,0,0,,What about the two years in juvie for boosting cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.54,0:26:15.77,ENG,191,0,0,0,,Tucson, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.84,0:26:19.57,ENG,192,0,0,0,,Yeah, I had Jesse run a profile on you, Brian Earl Spilner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.64,0:26:23.88,ENG,193,0,0,0,,He'll find anything on the Web, anything about anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.95,0:26:25.88,ENG,194,0,0,0,,So why bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.42,0:26:29.35,ENG,195,0,0,0,,So what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.29,0:26:33.52,ENG,196,0,0,0,,Two years in Lompoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.93,0:26:37.92,ENG,197,0,0,0,,I'll die before I go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.74,0:26:46.33,ENG,198,0,0,0,,- Oh, great. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.64,0:26:51.27,ENG,199,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a long-ass night, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.31,0:26:56.91,ENG,200,0,0,0,,Follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.42,0:27:08.19,ENG,201,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.57,0:27:49.93,ENG,202,0,0,0,,I thought we had an agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.00,0:27:52.20,ENG,203,0,0,0,,You stay away, I stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.27,0:27:54.93,ENG,204,0,0,0,,Everybody stays happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.01,0:27:57.10,ENG,205,0,0,0,,We got lost, Johnny. What do you want me to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.18,0:28:00.61,ENG,206,0,0,0,,- Who's  "we"? - My new mechanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.68,0:28:02.37,ENG,207,0,0,0,,Brian, meetJohnny Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.45,0:28:05.47,ENG,208,0,0,0,,The guy in the snakeskin pants, that's his cousin, Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:09.18,ENG,209,0,0,0,,So when are you gonna give me a shot at that Honda 2000 of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.25,0:28:11.95,ENG,210,0,0,0,,- This your ride? - It was. It's his now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.02,0:28:14.12,ENG,211,0,0,0,,No, it's not. I haven't taken delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.96,0:28:19.33,ENG,212,0,0,0,,Then it's nobody's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.40,0:28:21.80,ENG,213,0,0,0,,Somebody put in the wrench time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.67,0:28:27.76,ENG,214,0,0,0,,- What do you think, Lance? - It's an amazing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.84,0:28:29.60,ENG,215,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.58,0:28:33.51,ENG,216,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.25,0:28:37.81,ENG,217,0,0,0,,I'll see you in the desert next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.88,0:28:39.98,ENG,218,0,0,0,,Be ready to have your ass handed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.98,0:28:41.78,ENG,219,0,0,0,,You're gonna need more than that crotch rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.85,0:28:43.88,ENG,220,0,0,0,,I got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.73,0:28:59.20,ENG,221,0,0,0,,What the hell was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.27,0:29:02.20,ENG,222,0,0,0,,Long story. I'll tell you later. Let's get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.07,0:29:31.50,ENG,223,0,0,0,,NOS!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.45,0:29:46.14,ENG,224,0,0,0,,So, what the hell was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.22,0:29:47.88,ENG,225,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.95,0:29:50.01,ENG,226,0,0,0,,We got a 20-mile hike. Humor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.09,0:29:53.82,ENG,227,0,0,0,,A business deal that went sour.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.89,0:29:56.95,ENG,228,0,0,0,,Plus, I made the mistake of sleeping with his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.49,0:30:30.75,ENG,229,0,0,0,,Yo, Spilner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.33,0:30:33.76,ENG,230,0,0,0,,You want a beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.63,0:30:37.22,ENG,231,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.19,0:31:04.32,ENG,232,0,0,0,,We were all there, right? Falling behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.39,0:31:06.83,ENG,233,0,0,0,,- With all that nitrous. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.57,0:31:16.60,ENG,234,0,0,0,,Yo, Dom. We were just about to go looking for you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.15,0:31:25.64,ENG,235,0,0,0,,- Where were you? - There were mass cops there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.71,0:31:28.51,ENG,236,0,0,0,,They came in from every direction. Their shit was orchestrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:31.08,ENG,237,0,0,0,,- This your beer? - Yeah, that's my beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.12,0:31:36.11,ENG,238,0,0,0,,Yo, Einstein. Take it upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.13,0:31:39.29,ENG,239,0,0,0,,You can't detail a car with the cover on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.30,0:31:42.29,ENG,240,0,0,0,,Can't even get that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.36,0:31:43.80,ENG,241,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.67,0:31:47.29,ENG,242,0,0,0,,Am I all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.37,0:31:49.36,ENG,243,0,0,0,,It was just a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.11,0:31:55.27,ENG,244,0,0,0,,Yo, Dom! Why'd you bring the buster here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.34,0:31:57.34,ENG,245,0,0,0,,'Cause the buster kept me out of handcuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.41,0:32:00.18,ENG,246,0,0,0,,He didn't just run back to the fort!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.25,0:32:02.72,ENG,247,0,0,0,,The buster brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.76,0:32:12.16,ENG,248,0,0,0,,You can have any brew you want... as long as it's a Corona.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.23,0:32:15.25,ENG,249,0,0,0,,- Thanks, man. - That's Vince's, so enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.73,0:32:17.70,ENG,250,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.24,0:32:27.17,ENG,251,0,0,0,,Hey, bro, you got a bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:29.87,ENG,252,0,0,0,,Yeah, upstairs. First door on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.29,0:32:47.23,ENG,253,0,0,0,,He's got no call being up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.30,0:32:50.03,ENG,254,0,0,0,,- You don't know that fool for shit! - He's right, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.10,0:32:52.80,ENG,255,0,0,0,,Vince, there was a time when I didn't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.87,0:32:55.36,ENG,256,0,0,0,,That was in the third grade!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.81,0:32:59.97,ENG,257,0,0,0,,Yeah, so, what girls are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.04,0:33:02.88,ENG,258,0,0,0,,- You name it. You want mine? - You need to shut the f...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.18,0:33:06.81,ENG,259,0,0,0,,- You don't have anything? - You look a bit tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.88,0:33:08.94,ENG,260,0,0,0,,I think you should go upstairs and give me a massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.02,0:33:10.61,ENG,261,0,0,0,,Look at all our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.69,0:33:13.95,ENG,262,0,0,0,,How about we go upstairs and you give me a massage?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.56,0:33:17.99,ENG,263,0,0,0,,Crazy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.53,0:33:28.47,ENG,264,0,0,0,,You know you owe me a ten-second car, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.71,0:33:31.14,ENG,265,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.77,0:33:34.54,ENG,266,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.18,0:33:41.15,ENG,267,0,0,0,,Did you wipe the seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.72,0:33:47.48,ENG,268,0,0,0,,Oh, Jesus Christ! Would you cut the shit already?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:48.99,ENG,269,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.46,0:33:53.12,ENG,270,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's go get me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.26,0:33:56.20,ENG,271,0,0,0,,Come on, man. We were just about to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:05.87,ENG,272,0,0,0,,- So, what do you want? - Anything, long as it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.11,0:34:10.10,ENG,273,0,0,0,,My brother likes you. He usually doesn't like anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.18,0:34:12.74,ENG,274,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a complicated guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.81,0:34:14.75,ENG,275,0,0,0,,Yeah? What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:20.22,ENG,276,0,0,0,,- I'm simpler. - You're a shitty liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.39,0:34:23.82,ENG,277,0,0,0,,Well, I'll take that as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.39,0:34:28.06,ENG,278,0,0,0,,- But there's a problem. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:30.86,ENG,279,0,0,0,,You need to get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.93,0:34:35.30,ENG,280,0,0,0,,And you definitely, definitely need a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.37,0:34:38.10,ENG,281,0,0,0,,Come on. I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.93,0:35:03.26,ENG,282,0,0,0,,Show me your hands. Very good. Now open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:06.93,ENG,283,0,0,0,,Put your hands on your head. Behind your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.00,0:35:10.70,ENG,284,0,0,0,,Face the front of the vehicle, walk backwards towards the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.77,0:35:13.90,ENG,285,0,0,0,,Take two steps to your right. Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.18,0:35:18.61,ENG,286,0,0,0,,What'd I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.68,0:35:21.62,ENG,287,0,0,0,,Shut up. He's clean, Sarge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.93,0:35:34.56,ENG,288,0,0,0,,Damn! Muse, will you take these things off?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.63,0:35:37.16,ENG,289,0,0,0,,- Shit. You put 'em on so tight. - I like realism.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.23,0:35:44.94,ENG,290,0,0,0,,- You like realism. - You never know who's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.94,0:35:48.40,ENG,291,0,0,0,,Nice crib, Sergeant. It's a lot nicer than that last place you confiscated.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.47,0:35:52.71,ENG,292,0,0,0,,Ain't it? Eddie Fisher built this house for Elizabeth Taylor in the '50s.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.78,0:35:55.41,ENG,293,0,0,0,,See? Even the cops are Hollywood in Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.59,0:36:02.45,ENG,294,0,0,0,,Here he is, fresh from Toretto's hot rod heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.52,0:36:04.46,ENG,295,0,0,0,,That was an $80,000 vehicle, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.52,0:36:08.12,ENG,296,0,0,0,,- Wait. You tell him what happened? - He knows what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.19,0:36:11.56,ENG,297,0,0,0,,- Send the bill to Johnny Tran. - The kid's giving me attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.63,0:36:14.83,ENG,298,0,0,0,,That doesn't speak very well for police-FBI relations, Tanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.90,0:36:17.99,ENG,299,0,0,0,,- I walk in, the guy's already giving... - All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.07,0:36:20.30,ENG,300,0,0,0,,We'll talk, okay? Let's talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.37,0:36:23.67,ENG,301,0,0,0,,Muse, why don't you make us four iced cappuccinos, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.74,0:36:26.44,ENG,302,0,0,0,,- Come on. - Regular or decaf, Sarge?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.95,0:36:29.57,ENG,303,0,0,0,,Decaf, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.65,0:36:32.52,ENG,304,0,0,0,,Four hijackings in two months, and we don't have anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.52,0:36:35.59,ENG,305,0,0,0,,DVD players and digital cameras alone are won'th a million-two...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.65,0:36:38.28,ENG,306,0,0,0,,which brings the grand total to six million plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:41.49,ENG,307,0,0,0,,We're in the political crosshairs now, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.56,0:36:43.69,ENG,308,0,0,0,,That's why you're undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.76,0:36:47.66,ENG,309,0,0,0,,You want that detective badge fast, kid. And you wanna know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.73,0:36:51.10,ENG,310,0,0,0,,The FBI can help, if you come through for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.24,0:36:55.26,ENG,311,0,0,0,,- What does the truck driver say? - He gave us the same M.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.34,0:36:57.54,ENG,312,0,0,0,,Three Honda Civics, precision driving...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.61,0:37:00.77,ENG,313,0,0,0,,the same green neon glow from under the chassis.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.85,0:37:03.44,ENG,314,0,0,0,,Lab says the skid marks came back the same:
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.52,0:37:05.45,ENG,315,0,0,0,,Mashamoto ZX tires.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.52,0:37:08.01,ENG,316,0,0,0,,So we know that it's somebody in the street racing world.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.09,0:37:10.15,ENG,317,0,0,0,,We don't make this case soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.22,0:37:12.62,ENG,318,0,0,0,,the truckers will take matters into their own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.69,0:37:15.32,ENG,319,0,0,0,,I tell 'em we're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.39,0:37:17.33,ENG,320,0,0,0,,You gonna make me a liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:19.33,ENG,321,0,0,0,,Look, what do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.40,0:37:22.06,ENG,322,0,0,0,,We all know this world revolves around Toretto, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.13,0:37:25.07,ENG,323,0,0,0,,I'm not saying that he's necessarily the one that's popping these trucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.14,0:37:27.87,ENG,324,0,0,0,,but I can guarantee the both of you that he knows who is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.94,0:37:30.24,ENG,325,0,0,0,,- It's just a matter of time until... - You want time?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.31,0:37:33.84,ENG,326,0,0,0,,Buy the magazine. We don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.11,0:37:37.31,ENG,327,0,0,0,,Just get me something I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.48,0:37:40.51,ENG,328,0,0,0,,Is Harry cooperating?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.59,0:37:44.42,ENG,329,0,0,0,,Yeah, like a guy who's gonna do time for receiving stolen property if he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.49,0:37:46.48,ENG,330,0,0,0,,What kind of vibe is he getting from Toretto?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.56,0:37:49.62,ENG,331,0,0,0,,He's scared of him, but he doesn't think he's jacking trucks in his spare time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.70,0:37:52.13,ENG,332,0,0,0,,- He's too controlled for that. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.20,0:37:55.39,ENG,333,0,0,0,,Not that I want to contradict Harry's fine judge of character...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.47,0:37:59.27,ENG,334,0,0,0,,but Toretto did hard time for nearly beating a guy to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.34,0:38:02.10,ENG,335,0,0,0,,He's got nitrous oxide in his blood and a gas tank for a brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.17,0:38:04.11,ENG,336,0,0,0,,Do not turn your back on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.18,0:38:06.41,ENG,337,0,0,0,,Hey, Tanner. I'm gonna need another car.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.41,0:38:07.38,ENG,338,0,0,0,,Hey, Tanner. I'm gonna need another car.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.65,0:38:13.08,ENG,339,0,0,0,,What about parts and service?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.15,0:38:15.24,ENG,340,0,0,0,,- Hold off on that. - What should I do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.86,0:38:22.22,ENG,341,0,0,0,,All right, what the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.29,0:38:24.23,ENG,342,0,0,0,,What do you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.30,0:38:27.73,ENG,343,0,0,0,,- This is your car. - My car?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.80,0:38:31.26,ENG,344,0,0,0,,I said a ten-second car, not a ten-minute car.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.34,0:38:35.40,ENG,345,0,0,0,,You could push this across the finish line, or tow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.71,0:38:38.90,ENG,346,0,0,0,,Couldrt even tow that across the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.35,0:38:41.44,ENG,347,0,0,0,,No faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.51,0:38:44.11,ENG,348,0,0,0,,I have faith in you, but this isn't a junkyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.18,0:38:46.41,ENG,349,0,0,0,,- This is a garage. - Pop the hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.49,0:38:48.25,ENG,350,0,0,0,,- Pop the hood? - Pop the hood.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.89,0:38:52.32,ENG,351,0,0,0,,TwoJZ engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.39,0:38:55.09,ENG,352,0,0,0,,- No shit. - And what did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.16,0:38:57.49,ENG,353,0,0,0,,- I retract my previous statement. - You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.56,0:39:02.19,ENG,354,0,0,0,,This will decimate all after you put about 15 grand in it...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.27,0:39:05.67,ENG,355,0,0,0,,or more, if we have to overnight parts from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.74,0:39:08.04,ENG,356,0,0,0,,We'll put it on my tab at Harry's.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.11,0:39:09.54,ENG,357,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.61,0:39:13.77,ENG,358,0,0,0,,I gotta get you racing again so I can make some money off your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.85,0:39:17.84,ENG,359,0,0,0,,There's a show in the desert called Race Wars, and that's where you'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.42,0:39:22.65,ENG,360,0,0,0,,Tell you what. When you're not working at Harry's, you're working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.72,0:39:26.92,ENG,361,0,0,0,,If you can't find the right tool in this garage, Mr. Arizona...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.99,0:39:27.99,ENG,362,0,0,0,,you don't belong near a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.99,0:39:29.19,ENG,363,0,0,0,,You don't belong near a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.10,0:39:35.03,ENG,364,0,0,0,,He owns you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.76,0:40:01.99,ENG,365,0,0,0,,Tell me what you think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.99,0:40:04.18,ENG,366,0,0,0,,Koni adjustables.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.26,0:40:06.49,ENG,367,0,0,0,,Gonna save us about two pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.56,0:40:09.96,ENG,368,0,0,0,,And they're gonna give us better traction for the hole shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.03,0:40:11.73,ENG,369,0,0,0,,All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.80,0:40:14.20,ENG,370,0,0,0,,This is your basic layout of the car...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.27,0:40:18.80,ENG,371,0,0,0,,and that's pretty much what it could look like when it's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.87,0:40:20.81,ENG,372,0,0,0,,Red, green.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.88,0:40:23.00,ENG,373,0,0,0,,Man, you should be going to MIT or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:25.01,ENG,374,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:27.98,ENG,375,0,0,0,,No, I got that... Oh, what's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.05,0:40:32.21,ENG,376,0,0,0,,- That attention disorder... - ADD?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.29,0:40:34.98,ENG,377,0,0,0,,Yes, that shit. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.19,0:40:39.02,ENG,378,0,0,0,,You know, I was good in algebra and, like, math...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.09,0:40:40.75,ENG,379,0,0,0,,and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.83,0:40:42.82,ENG,380,0,0,0,,Everything else I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.90,0:40:45.76,ENG,381,0,0,0,,Dropped out of school. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.83,0:40:48.96,ENG,382,0,0,0,,It's just something about engines...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.04,0:40:52.84,ENG,383,0,0,0,,that calms me down, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.59,0:41:15.59,ENG,384,0,0,0,,- I'm outta here. - Come on, dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.66,0:41:18.36,ENG,385,0,0,0,,Vince, get over here and give us a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.43,0:41:20.76,ENG,386,0,0,0,,Looks like you got all the help you need, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.35,0:41:36.54,ENG,387,0,0,0,,- Mia! - All right already.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.62,0:41:39.92,ENG,388,0,0,0,,- The chickers dry. - I'm coming out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.19,0:41:48.59,ENG,389,0,0,0,,Hey, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.66,0:41:51.83,ENG,390,0,0,0,,Because you were the first out of everybody here...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.90,0:41:54.77,ENG,391,0,0,0,,to reach in to get the chicken, you say grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.31,0:42:02.28,ENG,392,0,0,0,,Dear heavenly, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.34,0:42:03.78,ENG,393,0,0,0,,Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.84,0:42:05.78,ENG,394,0,0,0,,Spirit. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.85,0:42:09.94,ENG,395,0,0,0,,Uh, thank you for providing us with a direct port...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.02,0:42:11.95,ENG,396,0,0,0,,nitrous, uh, injection...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.02,0:42:16.98,ENG,397,0,0,0,,four core intercoolers and ball-bearing turbos...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.06,0:42:20.19,ENG,398,0,0,0,,and, um, titanium valve springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.26,0:42:22.13,ENG,399,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.20,0:42:24.76,ENG,400,0,0,0,,- Not bad. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.83,0:42:28.10,ENG,401,0,0,0,,He was praying to the car gods, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.10,0:42:31.44,ENG,402,0,0,0,,- These are the best. - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.24,0:42:33.80,ENG,403,0,0,0,,- Practice. - Thank you, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.87,0:42:35.50,ENG,404,0,0,0,,Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.58,0:42:37.34,ENG,405,0,0,0,,Old Coyotes 'R' Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.41,0:42:39.54,ENG,406,0,0,0,,I thought you werert hungry, pumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.68,0:42:42.98,ENG,407,0,0,0,,- You know, I gotta eat. - He's always hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.05,0:42:44.81,ENG,408,0,0,0,,All right, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.79,0:42:54.73,ENG,409,0,0,0,,How you doing, Mia?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.61,0:43:08.67,ENG,410,0,0,0,,- Jesse, hand me that chicken. - Let's eat some grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.74,0:43:19.45,ENG,411,0,0,0,,- Want some of that chicken? - Did you rent a movie or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.45,0:43:20.89,ENG,412,0,0,0,,Need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.95,0:43:24.86,ENG,413,0,0,0,,No, I'm good. You can go join the boys watching the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.92,0:43:27.36,ENG,414,0,0,0,,Well, the cook doesn't clean where I come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.43,0:43:28.89,ENG,415,0,0,0,,I'd like to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.67,0:43:35.60,ENG,416,0,0,0,,I think we should go out sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.67,0:43:37.86,ENG,417,0,0,0,,No, I don't date my brother's friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.97,0:43:40.53,ENG,418,0,0,0,,That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.61,0:43:43.60,ENG,419,0,0,0,,- I guess I'll have to kick his ass then. - I'd love to see that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.68,0:43:47.44,ENG,420,0,0,0,,No, I would... I would pay to see that one, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.93,0:44:02.86,ENG,421,0,0,0,,Wash my car when you get done.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.93,0:44:05.19,ENG,422,0,0,0,,- What was that? - No, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.26,0:44:07.76,ENG,423,0,0,0,,I'm talking to the punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.83,0:44:10.27,ENG,424,0,0,0,,And wear your favorite dress, 'cause when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.34,0:44:13.13,ENG,425,0,0,0,,I'm putting you on the street where you belong, cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.28,0:44:18.30,ENG,426,0,0,0,,Is this thing broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.38,0:44:20.40,ENG,427,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.61,0:44:25.64,ENG,428,0,0,0,,V, what was that Cuban restaurant you wanted to take me to?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.72,0:44:27.81,ENG,429,0,0,0,,The one with the peccadillo and the...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.89,0:44:31.12,ENG,430,0,0,0,,- Red candles and the wooden table? - Yeah, the plantain too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.19,0:44:33.72,ENG,431,0,0,0,,- What was it called? - Cha Cha Cha.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.79,0:44:35.42,ENG,432,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.80,0:44:38.82,ENG,433,0,0,0,,Well, you can take me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.90,0:44:42.06,ENG,434,0,0,0,,Friday night at 10:00. Is that good for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.13,0:44:45.47,ENG,435,0,0,0,,- Yeah, it's perfect. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.68,0:44:54.61,ENG,436,0,0,0,,- There's no popcorn? - Make your own goddamn popcorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.56,0:45:11.16,ENG,437,0,0,0,,All right. Now that's valet parking.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.17,0:45:17.00,ENG,438,0,0,0,,- Harry. - What's up, dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.07,0:45:19.30,ENG,439,0,0,0,,Excellent, brother. Come on in, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.37,0:45:21.93,ENG,440,0,0,0,,- Check it. It's yours. - What do we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.38,0:45:26.44,ENG,441,0,0,0,,- Hired some new help, huh? - Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.51,0:45:28.57,ENG,442,0,0,0,,- What's up, Hector? - How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.65,0:45:31.05,ENG,443,0,0,0,,Pretty good. What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.12,0:45:35.05,ENG,444,0,0,0,,I need you to hook me up. Three of everything. I made a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.86,0:45:39.12,ENG,445,0,0,0,,Why don't you look that over.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.19,0:45:41.72,ENG,446,0,0,0,,- When do you need this stuff by? - Tomorrow. Today.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.79,0:45:43.23,ENG,447,0,0,0,,- Now. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.30,0:45:46.32,ENG,448,0,0,0,,White boys work fast, don't they? Beto.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.43,0:45:50.16,ENG,449,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.60,0:45:54.30,ENG,450,0,0,0,,You said you need three of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.37,0:45:56.18,ENG,451,0,0,0,,Yeah, three of everything. What do you think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.18,0:45:57.73,ENG,452,0,0,0,,Yeah, three of everything. What do you think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.81,0:46:00.14,ENG,453,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.24,0:48:09.17,ENG,454,0,0,0,,He moans like a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.08,0:48:20.07,ENG,455,0,0,0,,Brian, this is one of those times...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.15,0:48:22.68,ENG,456,0,0,0,,when you need to be very clear about what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.75,0:48:25.15,ENG,457,0,0,0,,Nod if you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.22,0:48:26.85,ENG,458,0,0,0,,Nod!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.06,0:48:29.72,ENG,459,0,0,0,,Sit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.10,0:48:38.40,ENG,460,0,0,0,,Tell me what the hell you're doing down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.47,0:48:41.60,ENG,461,0,0,0,,Oh, shit. What I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.71,0:48:50.01,ENG,462,0,0,0,,I owe... I owe you a ten-second car.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.55,0:48:55.01,ENG,463,0,0,0,,And what this is about, this is about Race Wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.32,0:48:59.45,ENG,464,0,0,0,,I just went in there, and Hector is gonna be running...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.52,0:49:05.26,ENG,465,0,0,0,,three Honda Civics with Spoon engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.33,0:49:08.09,ENG,466,0,0,0,,And on top of that, he just came into Harry's...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.16,0:49:11.87,ENG,467,0,0,0,,and he ordered three T-66 turbos...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.87,0:49:16.10,ENG,468,0,0,0,,with NOS, and a MoTeC system exhaust.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.01,0:49:20.94,ENG,469,0,0,0,,So, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.65,0:49:25.41,ENG,470,0,0,0,,You're gonna go around and check everybody's shit out...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.48,0:49:27.45,ENG,471,0,0,0,,one garage after another?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.82,0:49:30.75,ENG,472,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.69,0:49:36.68,ENG,473,0,0,0,,Because Dom, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.76,0:49:38.69,ENG,474,0,0,0,,I can't lose again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.13,0:49:42.19,ENG,475,0,0,0,,He's a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.47,0:49:45.13,ENG,476,0,0,0,,He's a cop!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.47,0:49:50.80,ENG,477,0,0,0,,You a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.21,0:49:58.27,ENG,478,0,0,0,,Let's go for a little ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.18,0:50:02.62,ENG,479,0,0,0,,Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.74,0:50:23.67,ENG,480,0,0,0,,All right, kid, stand watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.30,0:50:55.50,ENG,481,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.74,0:50:59.67,ENG,482,0,0,0,,There's no engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.74,0:51:03.34,ENG,483,0,0,0,,What are they planning on racing with? Hopes and dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.41,0:51:05.78,ENG,484,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I know they're sneaky as shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.85,0:51:08.18,ENG,485,0,0,0,,and they've got enough money to buy anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.02,0:51:14.96,ENG,486,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.43,0:51:25.49,ENG,487,0,0,0,,Dom, we got a wolf pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.57,0:51:29.53,ENG,488,0,0,0,,It's Johnny Tran, and he's comiryour way really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.61,0:51:31.23,ENG,489,0,0,0,,All right, we got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.31,0:51:33.14,ENG,490,0,0,0,,Spilner!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.57,0:52:00.66,ENG,491,0,0,0,,Come on. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.74,0:52:02.60,ENG,492,0,0,0,,Let me ask you a question, Ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.67,0:52:07.27,ENG,493,0,0,0,,Do you see anything wrong here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.38,0:52:08.37,ENG,494,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.88,0:52:14.25,ENG,495,0,0,0,,- We got no engines, do we? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.32,0:52:16.08,ENG,496,0,0,0,,- Do we? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.52,0:52:22.75,ENG,497,0,0,0,,Nissan SR-Twenty motors will pull a premium one week before Race Wars, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.83,0:52:24.59,ENG,498,0,0,0,,Yeah, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.66,0:52:28.10,ENG,499,0,0,0,,You're a smart fence, Ted. Maybe too smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.33,0:52:31.27,ENG,500,0,0,0,,What are you feelir, Lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.67,0:52:34.73,ENG,501,0,0,0,,Forty weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.80,0:52:36.74,ENG,502,0,0,0,,Fifty weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.81,0:52:38.74,ENG,503,0,0,0,,A forty weight sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.36,0:52:57.45,ENG,504,0,0,0,,Where are they, Ted? Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.53,0:52:59.05,ENG,505,0,0,0,,- Enough! - Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.13,0:53:01.15,ENG,506,0,0,0,,They're in a warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.23,0:53:03.10,ENG,507,0,0,0,,They're in a warehouse, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.32,0:53:21.85,ENG,508,0,0,0,,Kiss my shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.60,0:53:37.46,ENG,509,0,0,0,,Let's go get our engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.53,0:53:40.30,ENG,510,0,0,0,,My superiors are flying in from D.C. Day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.37,0:53:43.07,ENG,511,0,0,0,,I want something to show. Now, we have a top-echelon fence...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.14,0:53:45.57,ENG,512,0,0,0,,with a lube hose in his mouth, automatic weapons...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.64,0:53:48.27,ENG,513,0,0,0,,a jacket full of priors on every one of these Asian punks...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.34,0:53:51.64,ENG,514,0,0,0,,a garage full of DVD players and generally psychotic behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.71,0:53:55.12,ENG,515,0,0,0,,Why not move on Tran now, see where we are when the dust settles?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.18,0:53:58.21,ENG,516,0,0,0,,Because all we have is behavior. Let me get some hard evidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.29,0:54:00.19,ENG,517,0,0,0,,because what we have now is circumstantial...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.26,0:54:01.95,ENG,518,0,0,0,,What we have is probable cause and truckers arming themselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.03,0:54:06.03,ENG,519,0,0,0,,for some good old vigilante mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.10,0:54:08.16,ENG,520,0,0,0,,Tell us about Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.16,0:54:10.16,ENG,521,0,0,0,,Latinos with spear guns. Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.23,0:54:12.46,ENG,522,0,0,0,,Hector's still working on the engines for the cars...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.54,0:54:14.16,ENG,523,0,0,0,,but the tires don't match.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.24,0:54:15.83,ENG,524,0,0,0,,Will someone just give me a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.91,0:54:18.20,ENG,525,0,0,0,,- Get him a cigarette. - Don't get him a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.27,0:54:19.83,ENG,526,0,0,0,,- I thought you quit. - Yeah, I did quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.91,0:54:21.50,ENG,527,0,0,0,,- Just give me a cigarette. - Get him a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.58,0:54:22.24,ENG,528,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.25,0:54:29.78,ENG,529,0,0,0,,- Tell me about Toretto. - He's too controlled for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.85,0:54:32.15,ENG,530,0,0,0,,I mean, what? Going suicidal on semi trucks? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.22,0:54:34.49,ENG,531,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe his buddy Vince, but he's too stupid to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.56,0:54:37.82,ENG,532,0,0,0,,I think the kid sister's blurring your vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.89,0:54:39.42,ENG,533,0,0,0,,- What do you say? - I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.50,0:54:42.33,ENG,534,0,0,0,,I'd get off on her surveillance photos too, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.13,0:54:49.13,ENG,535,0,0,0,,Knock it off. What? Are you going native on me, Brian?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.41,0:54:57.04,ENG,536,0,0,0,,Have you read Toretto's file lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.11,0:54:59.55,ENG,537,0,0,0,,- Yeah. I memorized that file. - Yeah, well, read it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.62,0:55:01.64,ENG,538,0,0,0,,No. Better still. Take a look at these.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.95,0:55:06.72,ENG,539,0,0,0,,Remember I told you about the guy he nearly beat to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.59,0:55:11.08,ENG,540,0,0,0,,Toretto did this with a 3/4-inch torque wrench.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.16,0:55:14.39,ENG,541,0,0,0,,He's a model of self-control.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.50,0:55:18.43,ENG,542,0,0,0,,I need a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.80,0:55:21.77,ENG,543,0,0,0,,I need a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.77,0:55:22.74,ENG,544,0,0,0,,I need a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.01,0:55:31.95,ENG,545,0,0,0,,What it's gonna do is it's gonna spool up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.01,0:55:34.21,ENG,546,0,0,0,,I got this set up for 24 psi.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.89,0:55:39.75,ENG,547,0,0,0,,You got big plans tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.99,0:55:44.55,ENG,548,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're going out to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.63,0:55:47.46,ENG,549,0,0,0,,You break her heart, I'll break your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.83,0:55:51.36,ENG,550,0,0,0,,That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.54,0:55:57.17,ENG,551,0,0,0,,I wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.48,0:56:08.92,ENG,552,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.55,0:56:13.08,ENG,553,0,0,0,,Me and my dad built her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.09,0:56:19.59,ENG,554,0,0,0,,900 horses of Detroit muscle. It's a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.66,0:56:22.46,ENG,555,0,0,0,,- Know what she ran in Palmdale? - No. What did she run?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.53,0:56:24.36,ENG,556,0,0,0,,Nine seconds flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.74,0:56:28.03,ENG,557,0,0,0,,- God. - My dad was driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.10,0:56:32.54,ENG,558,0,0,0,,So much torque the chassis twisted coming off the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.64,0:56:36.17,ENG,559,0,0,0,,Barely kept her on the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.25,0:56:39.21,ENG,560,0,0,0,,- So what's your best time? - I've never driven her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.28,0:56:40.37,ENG,561,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.19,0:56:45.42,ENG,562,0,0,0,,Scares the shit out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.56,0:56:53.33,ENG,563,0,0,0,,That's my dad. He was coming up in the pro stock car circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.40,0:56:55.06,ENG,564,0,0,0,,Last race of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.87,0:57:01.20,ENG,565,0,0,0,,A guy named Kenny Linder came up from inside in the final turn...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.27,0:57:04.57,ENG,566,0,0,0,,and clipped his bumper and put him into the wall at 120.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.91,0:57:10.74,ENG,567,0,0,0,,I watched my dad burn to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.82,0:57:15.31,ENG,568,0,0,0,,I remembered hearing him scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.12,0:57:22.75,ENG,569,0,0,0,,The people that were there said he had died before the tanks blew.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.03,0:57:31.97,ENG,570,0,0,0,,They said it was me who was screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.90,0:57:37.53,ENG,571,0,0,0,,I saw Linder about a week later.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.61,0:57:42.41,ENG,572,0,0,0,,I had a wrench, and I hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.48,0:57:44.24,ENG,573,0,0,0,,And I didn't intend to keep hitting him...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.31,0:57:47.61,ENG,574,0,0,0,,but by the time I was done, I couldn't lift my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.56,0:57:54.99,ENG,575,0,0,0,,He's a janitor at a high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.06,0:57:58.65,ENG,576,0,0,0,,Has to take the bus to work every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.73,0:58:03.13,ENG,577,0,0,0,,And they banned me from the tracks for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.10,0:58:10.60,ENG,578,0,0,0,,I live my life a quarter-mile at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.44,0:58:15.17,ENG,579,0,0,0,,Nothing else matters... not the mortgage, not the store...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.24,0:58:18.34,ENG,580,0,0,0,,not my team and all that bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.55,0:58:22.07,ENG,581,0,0,0,,For those ten seconds or less...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.55,0:58:25.28,ENG,582,0,0,0,,I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.54,0:58:48.94,ENG,583,0,0,0,,So how is it, anyways, that the gang came to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.01,0:58:50.24,ENG,584,0,0,0,,- What? - The gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.31,0:58:52.87,ENG,585,0,0,0,,The gang? No, they don't call themselves a gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.95,0:58:55.11,ENG,586,0,0,0,,- What do they call themselves? - They're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.18,0:58:58.71,ENG,587,0,0,0,,- They call themselves a team. - How is it the team came to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.69,0:59:01.85,ENG,588,0,0,0,,Well, that's a whole lot of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.09,0:59:05.42,ENG,589,0,0,0,,I've got time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.49,0:59:07.76,ENG,590,0,0,0,,Vince grew up with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.83,0:59:11.03,ENG,591,0,0,0,,He didn't ever actually grow up, as you can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.67,0:59:15.90,ENG,592,0,0,0,,But they were friends as kids. And Letty, she lived down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.97,0:59:19.27,ENG,593,0,0,0,,Always into cars, though, ever since she was ten years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.34,0:59:23.47,ENG,594,0,0,0,,So, naturally, my brother always had her attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.55,0:59:27.68,ENG,595,0,0,0,,- And then she turned 16... - And then she had Dom's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.75,0:59:31.41,ENG,596,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah, it's funny how that works, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.49,0:59:32.42,ENG,597,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.16,0:59:38.25,ENG,598,0,0,0,,How is it thatJesse fits into the whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.46,0:59:42.33,ENG,599,0,0,0,,Well, Jesse and Leon just sort of showed up one night...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.40,0:59:44.09,ENG,600,0,0,0,,and never ever left.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.70,0:59:47.53,ENG,601,0,0,0,,It's just the way my brother is. Dom's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.27,0:59:51.21,ENG,602,0,0,0,,He's like gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.34,0:59:54.57,ENG,603,0,0,0,,Everything just gets pulled to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.25,0:59:57.91,ENG,604,0,0,0,,Even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.92,1:00:02.11,ENG,605,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.12,1:00:05.88,ENG,606,0,0,0,,The only thing that pulled me in was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.96,1:00:08.29,ENG,607,0,0,0,,Being friends with your brother is just a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.66,1:00:13.25,ENG,608,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.13,1:00:19.03,ENG,609,0,0,0,,That's good. That's nice to come first every once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.44,1:00:23.93,ENG,610,0,0,0,,You wanna go for a drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.98,1:01:04.17,ENG,611,0,0,0,,- Yeah? - The hijackers have hit again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.25,1:01:06.74,ENG,612,0,0,0,,Bilkins made his decision. We're gonna move onJohnny Tran...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.82,1:01:11.34,ENG,613,0,0,0,,and his guys at 1700 hours, unless you say otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.42,1:01:14.12,ENG,614,0,0,0,,If you agree, just say yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.19,1:01:16.28,ENG,615,0,0,0,,- Yeah. - Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.03,1:01:19.96,ENG,616,0,0,0,,Just a wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.93,1:02:04.02,ENG,617,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.13,1:04:14.15,ENG,618,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Yeah, I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.23,1:04:16.93,ENG,619,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Yes. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.00,1:04:18.99,ENG,620,0,0,0,,Yeah. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.27,1:04:25.24,ENG,621,0,0,0,,The DVD players were purchased legally.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.31,1:04:28.44,ENG,622,0,0,0,,All we've got on Tran and company are a couple of weapons charges...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.51,1:04:31.04,ENG,623,0,0,0,,and some outstanding speeding tickets.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.11,1:04:35.52,ENG,624,0,0,0,,- So they're out. - Yeah. Father bailed 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.58,1:04:38.68,ENG,625,0,0,0,,Is this the kind of intelligence I can expect from you, O'Conner?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.03,1:04:47.15,ENG,626,0,0,0,,- You're gonna put this on me? - I can put it on whoever I want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.23,1:04:50.46,ENG,627,0,0,0,,- Perks of the job. - No way you're gonna put this on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.53,1:04:52.12,ENG,628,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. Let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.20,1:04:53.96,ENG,629,0,0,0,,I don't care if you have to put a gun to someone's head...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.04,1:04:56.47,ENG,630,0,0,0,,and blow your cover to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.54,1:04:59.03,ENG,631,0,0,0,,You got 36 hours to crack this bastard...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.11,1:05:01.63,ENG,632,0,0,0,,or you might wanna be thinking about another career.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.32,1:05:16.78,ENG,633,0,0,0,,It's Toretto, Brian. It always has been Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.09,1:05:21.89,ENG,634,0,0,0,,Tran and Hector are... They're just fumes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.33,1:05:28.06,ENG,635,0,0,0,,Well, I know you've been lying to me. My question is this:
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.14,1:05:30.83,ENG,636,0,0,0,,Have you been lying to yourself because you can't see past Mia?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.51,1:05:37.38,ENG,637,0,0,0,,He won't go back to prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.45,1:05:40.35,ENG,638,0,0,0,,Well, that's a choice he's going to have to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.49,1:05:46.78,ENG,639,0,0,0,,There's all kinds of family, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.36,1:05:51.35,ENG,640,0,0,0,,That's a choice you're gonna have to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.11,1:06:11.67,ENG,641,0,0,0,,You ready for this, jumpy?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.21,1:06:14.15,ENG,642,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.27,1:06:40.50,ENG,643,0,0,0,,Nice car. What's the retail on one of those?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.58,1:06:44.01,ENG,644,0,0,0,,More than you can afford, pal. Ferrari.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.88,1:06:50.82,ENG,645,0,0,0,,Smoke 'im.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.04,1:07:50.53,ENG,646,0,0,0,,- So what's wrong, Brian? - Nothir, man. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.61,1:07:54.45,ENG,647,0,0,0,,Come on. Obviously something's off.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.52,1:07:58.65,ENG,648,0,0,0,,Look. I have my good days, and I have my bad days, like anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.25,1:08:02.69,ENG,649,0,0,0,,Brian, don't lose that cool. That's your meal ticket.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.73,1:08:07.66,ENG,650,0,0,0,,My meal ticket? What? I can't pay for my own shrimp?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.73,1:08:11.19,ENG,651,0,0,0,,- I got your shrimp. - That's one thing about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.27,1:08:14.10,ENG,652,0,0,0,,You don't understand. I don't need handouts. I don't take handouts.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.17,1:08:15.97,ENG,653,0,0,0,,I earn my way, every step.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.07,1:08:19.27,ENG,654,0,0,0,,I just gotta make a little something extra on the side, like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.34,1:08:21.54,ENG,655,0,0,0,,What do you mean, like me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.61,1:08:24.54,ENG,656,0,0,0,,- What's that supposed to mean? - That's what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.61,1:08:27.55,ENG,657,0,0,0,,- What does that mean, like me? - Don't try...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.62,1:08:29.74,ENG,658,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.82,1:08:33.88,ENG,659,0,0,0,,I know there's no way you paid for all that shit under the hood...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.96,1:08:37.41,ENG,660,0,0,0,,There's no way you paid for all that shit under the hood of those cars...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.49,1:08:39.82,ENG,661,0,0,0,,by doing tune-ups and selling groceries.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.10,1:08:43.76,ENG,662,0,0,0,,Now, whatever it is you're in on, I want in on it too.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.12,1:09:09.64,ENG,663,0,0,0,,- What is this? - Read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.72,1:09:12.28,ENG,664,0,0,0,,- What is this for? - It's directions.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.39,1:09:18.23,ENG,665,0,0,0,,To Race Wars. We'll see how you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.46,1:09:21.56,ENG,666,0,0,0,,Then we'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.44,1:10:05.00,ENG,667,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.21,1:10:08.61,ENG,668,0,0,0,,- How's it goir, bro? - What's up, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.68,1:10:10.44,ENG,669,0,0,0,,Welcome to Race Wars.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.51,1:10:12.78,ENG,670,0,0,0,,Great. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.77,1:10:36.36,ENG,671,0,0,0,,Baby. Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.11,1:10:41.57,ENG,672,0,0,0,,You should watch from the side. I wouldn't want to get exhaust on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.65,1:10:45.58,ENG,673,0,0,0,,- Put your money where your mouth is? - How 'bout I race you for that ass?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.28,1:10:48.48,ENG,674,0,0,0,,You want ass, why don't you hit Hollywood Boulevard?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.55,1:10:52.11,ENG,675,0,0,0,,You want an adrenaline rush, it'll be two large.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.19,1:10:54.75,ENG,676,0,0,0,,Right here, right now. What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.66,1:10:58.92,ENG,677,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.22,1:11:20.91,ENG,678,0,0,0,,Another one bites the dust.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.39,1:11:26.79,ENG,679,0,0,0,,Come on. What do you got? What ya got?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.86,1:11:28.69,ENG,680,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.79,1:12:06.13,ENG,681,0,0,0,,Whoa. Bri, what's up? Whoa. Bri, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.20,1:12:09.26,ENG,682,0,0,0,,What's up, Jesse? What do you have in your hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.33,1:12:12.17,ENG,683,0,0,0,,Throwing down the pink slip, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.24,1:12:14.83,ENG,684,0,0,0,,- The pink slip to what? TheJetta? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.91,1:12:17.43,ENG,685,0,0,0,,- You can't bet your dad's car. - It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.51,1:12:22.67,ENG,686,0,0,0,,I ain't losing. This fool is running a Honda 2000. I'll win.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.75,1:12:26.91,ENG,687,0,0,0,,That way, me and my dad can roll together when he gets out of prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.98,1:12:28.75,ENG,688,0,0,0,,They're gonna throw him right back in prison after he kills you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.82,1:12:30.98,ENG,689,0,0,0,,Shit. I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.60,1:12:42.33,ENG,690,0,0,0,,Visualize the win. Visualize the win, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.40,1:12:45.06,ENG,691,0,0,0,,- I'm serious. Listen to me, man. - Who you racing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.54,1:12:54.53,ENG,692,0,0,0,,Don't do it. I bet you he's got more than a hundred grand under the hood.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.87,1:13:20.93,ENG,693,0,0,0,,Too soon, junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.45,1:13:29.94,ENG,694,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.01,1:13:31.78,ENG,695,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.79,1:13:44.73,ENG,696,0,0,0,,Heads up, bro. We got problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.80,1:13:47.23,ENG,697,0,0,0,,- What? - Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.23,1:13:51.29,ENG,698,0,0,0,,- Where's Jesse going? - He just raced Tran for slips.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.37,1:13:53.89,ENG,699,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.45,1:14:08.35,ENG,700,0,0,0,,- Where's he going? - He went to the car wash.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.42,1:14:10.58,ENG,701,0,0,0,,Whatever. Go fetch my car.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.26,1:14:15.52,ENG,702,0,0,0,,Go fetch your car? We're not on your block anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.59,1:14:17.69,ENG,703,0,0,0,,You'd better watch who you talk to like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.33,1:14:27.86,ENG,704,0,0,0,,SWAT came into my house, disrespected my whole family...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.94,1:14:30.27,ENG,705,0,0,0,,because somebody narced me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.04,1:14:33.17,ENG,706,0,0,0,,And you know what? It was you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.16,1:14:47.35,ENG,707,0,0,0,,Go! Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.07,1:15:00.90,ENG,708,0,0,0,,Get off of him! Get off of him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.95,1:15:11.14,ENG,709,0,0,0,,Dom, chill out, man. Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.22,1:15:15.05,ENG,710,0,0,0,,I never narced on nobody! I never narced on nobody!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.59,1:15:55.86,ENG,711,0,0,0,,Mia!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.80,1:16:06.24,ENG,712,0,0,0,,- I'm asking you not to go. - I'm doing this for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.30,1:16:08.24,ENG,713,0,0,0,,Don't give me that crap. You're doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.31,1:16:11.07,ENG,714,0,0,0,,- Why are you asking me to stay? - Why do you insist on doing this?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.07,1:16:13.13,ENG,715,0,0,0,,Dom, please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.39,1:16:27.88,ENG,716,0,0,0,,- What's going on? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.96,1:16:30.52,ENG,717,0,0,0,,- You know what I'm talking about. - No, I don't, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.59,1:16:33.75,ENG,718,0,0,0,,So what? You always have tears in your eyes when Dom drives away?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.83,1:16:35.69,ENG,719,0,0,0,,- What is the matter with you? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.76,1:16:37.82,ENG,720,0,0,0,,What's your brother racing off in the middle of the night for?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.90,1:16:39.42,ENG,721,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the trucks. You know about the trucks?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.50,1:16:41.73,ENG,722,0,0,0,,No, Brian. What trucks?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.80,1:16:43.43,ENG,723,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.50,1:16:46.53,ENG,724,0,0,0,,- What? - Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.61,1:16:49.08,ENG,725,0,0,0,,Mia, I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.14,1:16:51.34,ENG,726,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Brian? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.18,1:16:55.17,ENG,727,0,0,0,,Ever since the first time I met you, I've been undercover.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.05,1:16:58.48,ENG,728,0,0,0,,I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.02,1:17:05.19,ENG,729,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.83,1:17:09.96,ENG,730,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.47,1:17:13.66,ENG,731,0,0,0,,Get off of me, Brian!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.74,1:17:16.20,ENG,732,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.27,1:17:20.17,ENG,733,0,0,0,,Everything I ever said I felt about you was real, I swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.24,1:17:23.54,ENG,734,0,0,0,,You have to believe me. But right now, this isn't about you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.61,1:17:26.34,ENG,735,0,0,0,,Your brother's about to pull a job, and we're almost out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.41,1:17:29.08,ENG,736,0,0,0,,Those truckers, they're not laying down anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.15,1:17:30.55,ENG,737,0,0,0,,They may make it through the night, but every law enforcement agency...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.62,1:17:33.68,ENG,738,0,0,0,,in California is coming down on 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.46,1:17:36.42,ENG,739,0,0,0,,If you don't want anything to happen to your brother, to Letty...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.42,1:17:39.29,ENG,740,0,0,0,,to Leon, to Vince, you have to just get in that car with me right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.36,1:17:41.29,ENG,741,0,0,0,,You have to help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.13,1:17:45.53,ENG,742,0,0,0,,Mia, you are the only person that can help me right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.23,1:17:49.53,ENG,743,0,0,0,,Please, Mia. Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.28,1:18:04.25,ENG,744,0,0,0,,Civics are stashed somewhere outside ofThermal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.32,1:18:07.88,ENG,745,0,0,0,,They wouldn't double back. And Highway 10's too well-patrolled...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.96,1:18:09.05,ENG,746,0,0,0,,so what does that leave us with then?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.12,1:18:10.82,ENG,747,0,0,0,,That leaves us with all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.70,1:18:22.60,ENG,748,0,0,0,,- Nextel. - Yes, this is Officer O'Conner...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.67,1:18:25.33,ENG,749,0,0,0,,serial number 34762.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.41,1:18:27.27,ENG,750,0,0,0,,I need a cell phone trace.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.34,1:18:30.21,ENG,751,0,0,0,,- What's the cell number? - Mia, what's the cell phone number?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.61,1:18:35.17,ENG,752,0,0,0,,Come on, Mia. She needs Dom's cell phone number now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.45,1:18:43.36,ENG,753,0,0,0,,323-555-6439.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.86,1:18:47.76,ENG,754,0,0,0,,Thank you. You get that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.69,1:19:17.06,ENG,755,0,0,0,,All right. We're one man short. Letty, I need you on the left side.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.63,1:19:22.82,ENG,756,0,0,0,,Your sister's right about this one. This don't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.90,1:19:24.96,ENG,757,0,0,0,,Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.07,1:19:27.97,ENG,758,0,0,0,,- Something's wrong. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.04,1:19:30.09,ENG,759,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be doing this without Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.41,1:19:34.24,ENG,760,0,0,0,,Look. This is the mother lode. We've been on this for three months.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.31,1:19:36.80,ENG,761,0,0,0,,After this, it's a long vacation for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.88,1:19:39.31,ENG,762,0,0,0,,- Let's go. - I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.52,1:19:46.58,ENG,763,0,0,0,,Listen. The other night I had a dream that you and I...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.65,1:19:49.18,ENG,764,0,0,0,,were on a beach in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.26,1:19:50.82,ENG,765,0,0,0,,- Really? - Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.36,1:19:56.63,ENG,766,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's make this happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.04,1:20:03.47,ENG,767,0,0,0,,- Keep on those scanners. - Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.34,1:20:09.28,ENG,768,0,0,0,,All right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.42,1:20:20.35,ENG,769,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.42,1:20:23.12,ENG,770,0,0,0,,We traced the number to the northbound 86...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.19,1:20:26.02,ENG,771,0,0,0,,mile 114 outside Coachella.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.09,1:20:28.72,ENG,772,0,0,0,,- We'll keep the trace open. - Let me see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.54,1:20:37.23,ENG,773,0,0,0,,All right. I think we're about 40 miles away.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.31,1:20:39.07,ENG,774,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.11,1:20:42.44,ENG,775,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.41,1:21:16.50,ENG,776,0,0,0,,Okay! Go time!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.19,1:21:34.25,ENG,777,0,0,0,,We're all good, man. I got nothing on the scanners.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.33,1:21:35.59,ENG,778,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.35,1:21:54.25,ENG,779,0,0,0,,Don't! Get back in!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.89,1:22:06.83,ENG,780,0,0,0,,- He's got a damn shotgun! - Back off! Get him off of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.83,1:22:11.30,ENG,781,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.48,1:22:24.41,ENG,782,0,0,0,,Get me off this thing! Pull up!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.75,1:22:28.31,ENG,783,0,0,0,,- Unook yourself! - Come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.38,1:22:30.61,ENG,784,0,0,0,,- Do it! - Pull up!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.69,1:22:32.29,ENG,785,0,0,0,,- I can't... - You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.29,1:22:33.95,ENG,786,0,0,0,,Pull up! I'll jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.02,1:22:35.68,ENG,787,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.60,1:22:46.00,ENG,788,0,0,0,,I'm pulling up to distract him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.04,1:22:55.63,ENG,789,0,0,0,,Come on, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.71,1:22:57.34,ENG,790,0,0,0,,Shot doesn't get better than this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.78,1:23:04.98,ENG,791,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.62,1:23:11.15,ENG,792,0,0,0,,Take me off of here. I'm gonna unook the wire.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.23,1:23:15.49,ENG,793,0,0,0,,Try it again. One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.61,1:23:30.41,ENG,794,0,0,0,,Unook yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.48,1:23:34.24,ENG,795,0,0,0,,- I can't get my arm free! - Vince, grab my hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.32,1:23:36.68,ENG,796,0,0,0,,- My arm! - Listen! Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.75,1:23:38.84,ENG,797,0,0,0,,- I can't get my hand free! - I'm gonna pull you off!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.56,1:23:47.76,ENG,798,0,0,0,,Dominic, hold on! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.67,1:23:57.73,ENG,799,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.24,1:24:03.51,ENG,800,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.81,1:24:06.94,ENG,801,0,0,0,,Move out of the way! I'm coming to get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.31,1:24:36.77,ENG,802,0,0,0,,- Yo? - Pull back for Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.84,1:24:39.75,ENG,803,0,0,0,,- Get her out of there! - I'm on it! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.52,1:24:50.72,ENG,804,0,0,0,,I got her! You get Vince off that truck!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.00,1:24:59.97,ENG,805,0,0,0,,Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.03,1:25:01.90,ENG,806,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.97,1:25:04.94,ENG,807,0,0,0,,Come on, girl. You all right? Come on. Let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.01,1:25:07.24,ENG,808,0,0,0,,Come on. We gotta go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.95,1:25:52.71,ENG,809,0,0,0,,- Take the wheel! - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.79,1:25:54.28,ENG,810,0,0,0,,Put your foot on the gas!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.36,1:25:56.19,ENG,811,0,0,0,,- What the hell are you gonna do? - I'm gonna get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.26,1:25:58.88,ENG,812,0,0,0,,- Put your foot on the gas! - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.86,1:26:05.83,ENG,813,0,0,0,,- All right. Keep it steady. - I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.07,1:26:09.23,ENG,814,0,0,0,,All right. Hold on, Vince!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.30,1:26:12.64,ENG,815,0,0,0,,He's having a hard time holding on! Get me a little closer!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.71,1:26:13.64,ENG,816,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.84,1:26:17.21,ENG,817,0,0,0,,- Closer! - I'm moving in!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.28,1:26:19.64,ENG,818,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.88,1:26:25.55,ENG,819,0,0,0,,- Go! - You gotta hang in with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.62,1:26:27.81,ENG,820,0,0,0,,We're gonna get you off this thing! Give me your arm!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.89,1:26:30.19,ENG,821,0,0,0,,Look at me. Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.19,1:26:36.69,ENG,822,0,0,0,,Come on, Vince! Throw this arm around me!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.43,1:26:40.26,ENG,823,0,0,0,,Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.94,1:26:45.60,ENG,824,0,0,0,,Come on, Vince! Get closer!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.55,1:26:53.57,ENG,825,0,0,0,,Vince, get closer! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.65,1:26:54.74,ENG,826,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.92,1:27:01.79,ENG,827,0,0,0,,Gotta jump.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.01,1:27:24.44,ENG,828,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.88,1:27:31.98,ENG,829,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay, baby. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.22,1:27:36.15,ENG,830,0,0,0,,Watch her.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.89,1:27:39.83,ENG,831,0,0,0,,Come on, Vince. Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.53,1:27:46.56,ENG,832,0,0,0,,If we don't get him to an ambulance in ten minutes, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.80,1:27:49.06,ENG,833,0,0,0,,- Hold this. Hold the pressure. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.14,1:27:50.66,ENG,834,0,0,0,,Don't let go. Hold his arm up.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.41,1:28:00.01,ENG,835,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah, this is Officer Brian O'Conner.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.08,1:28:02.24,ENG,836,0,0,0,,I'm off-duty M.A.P.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.32,1:28:04.34,ENG,837,0,0,0,,I need a life flight rollout right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.02,1:28:09.68,ENG,838,0,0,0,,My twenty is Highway 86, mile marker 147.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.76,1:28:16.53,ENG,839,0,0,0,,I got one trauma victim, about 24 years of age, six foot...  maybe 200 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.60,1:28:19.69,ENG,840,0,0,0,,He's got a deep laceration to his right arm with arterial bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.43,1:28:24.89,ENG,841,0,0,0,,And he's got a shotgun wound, close-range, to his left leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.97,1:28:26.63,ENG,842,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.71,1:28:29.47,ENG,843,0,0,0,,Yeah. And he's going into shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.71,1:30:11.41,ENG,844,0,0,0,,Put the gun down now!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.01,1:30:16.45,ENG,845,0,0,0,,- Move your car. - Bullshit. Put it down now!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.52,1:30:19.31,ENG,846,0,0,0,,- No more running. - I'm not running!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.16,1:30:24.72,ENG,847,0,0,0,,- Where's Leon and Letty? - They're long gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.79,1:30:27.99,ENG,848,0,0,0,,Then it's over. I didn't call the police, but don't push me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.06,1:30:31.00,ENG,849,0,0,0,,- Put the gun down! I swear to Go... - You are the cop!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.06,1:30:32.62,ENG,850,0,0,0,,You're a cop!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.83,1:30:37.33,ENG,851,0,0,0,,Brian, I gotta find Jesse before they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.40,1:30:40.37,ENG,852,0,0,0,,- I'm all the kid's got. - I'll call in the plates.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.44,1:30:43.57,ENG,853,0,0,0,,P.D.'ll pick 'im up way before Johnny even gets near 'im.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.51,1:30:47.48,ENG,854,0,0,0,,- Move your car. - Dom, stop it! It's over! Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.55,1:30:51.24,ENG,855,0,0,0,,Mia, stay out of it. Move the...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.36,1:31:00.35,ENG,856,0,0,0,,I am so sorry. I don't know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.56,1:31:04.96,ENG,857,0,0,0,,I'm so scared right now. I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.30,1:31:09.76,ENG,858,0,0,0,,- What were you thinkir, man? - I don't know. I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.84,1:31:14.50,ENG,859,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I don't know what I'm doing. Will you please help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.93,1:31:43.67,ENG,860,0,0,0,,Jesse!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.16,1:34:58.15,ENG,861,0,0,0,,Call 911. You, call 911!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.17,1:35:36.53,ENG,862,0,0,0,,I used to drag here back in high school.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.60,1:35:40.90,ENG,863,0,0,0,,That railroad crossing up there is exactly a quarter-mile away.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.94,1:35:44.41,ENG,864,0,0,0,,On green, I'm going for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.10,1:38:21.59,ENG,865,0,0,0,,That's not what I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.91,1:39:09.85,ENG,866,0,0,0,,You know what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.18,1:39:12.45,ENG,867,0,0,0,,I owe you a ten-second car.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.25,1:46:28.94,ENG,868,0,0,0,,I live my life a quarter-mile at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.58,1:46:32.35,ENG,869,0,0,0,,Nothing else matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.42,1:46:35.98,ENG,870,0,0,0,,For those ten seconds or less...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.82,1:46:38.15,ENG,871,0,0,0,,I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:42.34,CHS,1,0,0,0,,《速度与激情》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:03.57,CHS,2,0,0,0,,卡车上装满了值钱的货 正朝你的方向开去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.64,0:01:05.90,CHS,3,0,0,0,,在卡车侧面 写着“罗杰”的就是目标物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:08.41,CHS,4,0,0,0,,别忘了我那一份
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:03:58.22,CHS,5,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:03:58.65,CHS,6,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.68,CHS,7,0,0,0,,(杜洛托咖啡屋)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:41.69,CHS,8,0,0,0,,- 去边的鲔鱼三明治  对不对？ - 我还没决定  今天的好吃吗？ 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:46.15,CHS,9,0,0,0,,在过去的三个礼拜中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:48.46,CHS,10,0,0,0,,你天天问我鲔鱼三明治好不好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:50.02,CHS,11,0,0,0,,昨天很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:52.36,CHS,12,0,0,0,,前天也不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:55.37,CHS,13,0,0,0,,- 今天还是一样 - 那就来份鲔鱼三明治吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:58.37,CHS,14,0,0,0,,- 要去边吗？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:23.60,CHS,15,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:13.18,CHS,16,0,0,0,,这部车是有点不对劲 杰西  你看是什么毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:16.45,CHS,17,0,0,0,,应该是燃料系统漏油的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.11,CHS,18,0,0,0,,- 所以在第三档就上不去 - 我就说是第三档吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:22.02,CHS,19,0,0,0,,我把脉冲喷油嘴加长一毫秒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.09,0:06:25.03,CHS,20,0,0,0,,再调整氧化亚氮燃油注入器 问题就解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:34.84,CHS,21,0,0,0,,这个傻瓜怎么回事 吃三明治好像吃上瘾了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.91,0:06:36.84,CHS,22,0,0,0,,他才不是为吃而来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:39.54,CHS,23,0,0,0,,少胡扯 他是哈瑞新雇的销售员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:42.98,CHS,24,0,0,0,,- 我知道他想干什么 - 他想和蜜雅上床
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:45.48,CHS,25,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么样？ - 蜜雅  你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:46.98,CHS,26,0,0,0,,你还是活的那么刺激吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:50.91,CHS,27,0,0,0,,唐  要饮料吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:03.73,CHS,28,0,0,0,,他挺帅的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.39,CHS,29,0,0,0,,我喜欢他的发型
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:07.40,CHS,30,0,0,0,,文斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:08.27,CHS,31,0,0,0,,文斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:11.93,CHS,32,0,0,0,,- 干什么？ - 你要吃什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:15.68,CHS,33,0,0,0,,你今天很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:21.31,CHS,34,0,0,0,,谢谢你  蜜雅  明天见
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.39,0:07:22.82,CHS,35,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:29.11,CHS,36,0,0,0,,- 明天？ - 我最喜欢这一段 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:32.59,CHS,37,0,0,0,,从现在起你改吃汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:36.06,CHS,38,0,0,0,,只要两块九毛五就能吃一客 双层起司汉堡和薯条  死玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:39.26,CHS,39,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢这里的鲔鱼三明治 - 胡说  没有人喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:40.89,CHS,40,0,0,0,,我就喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.91,CHS,41,0,0,0,,天呐！唐  你过来一下好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:58.61,CHS,42,0,0,0,,烦死人了 告诉你我可不是开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:00.45,CHS,43,0,0,0,,快去呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:06.39,CHS,44,0,0,0,,- 你在三明治里放了什么东西 - 你以为自己很幽默
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.22,CHS,45,0,0,0,,唐！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:09.22,CHS,46,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:30.38,CHS,47,0,0,0,,- 他在我面前张牙舞爪 - 现在是我在你面前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:34.95,CHS,48,0,0,0,,行啦  少逞强 你太让我没面子了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:39.76,CHS,49,0,0,0,,到那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.99,CHS,50,0,0,0,,杰西  把他的皮夹给我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:48.29,CHS,51,0,0,0,,“布莱恩厄尔史皮尼” 像个杀人犯的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:50.03,CHS,52,0,0,0,,- 你是杀人犯吗？ - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.94,CHS,53,0,0,0,,以后不准再来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:57.34,CHS,54,0,0,0,,我有行动的自由
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:09:00.47,CHS,55,0,0,0,,- 你是替哈瑞做事吗？ - 对  才刚开始上班
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.38,CHS,56,0,0,0,,你已经被开除了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:07.35,CHS,57,0,0,0,,(赛车边缘 高性能汽车零件)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:18.19,CHS,58,0,0,0,,唐老大 谢谢你大批的向我买货
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:20.53,CHS,59,0,0,0,,我永远记得你的恩惠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:25.14,CHS,60,0,0,0,,布莱恩  你想让我关门吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:27.14,CHS,61,0,0,0,,只要唐老大开车  他就是财神
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:30.44,CHS,62,0,0,0,,大家都跑来买他所用的零件
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:32.14,CHS,63,0,0,0,,而且都是付现金的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:35.15,CHS,64,0,0,0,,- 唐说了些什么？ - 你不会爱听的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:38.62,CHS,65,0,0,0,,- 他到底说了什么？ - 他要你滚蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:40.71,CHS,66,0,0,0,,- 他要我滚蛋？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:44.48,CHS,67,0,0,0,,- 那你又怎么说呢？ - 你想我能说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:47.43,CHS,68,0,0,0,,我只能说“好帮手很难请”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:51.46,CHS,69,0,0,0,,你放心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:56.50,CHS,70,0,0,0,,我需要氧化亚氮燃油注入系统
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:58.77,CHS,71,0,0,0,,- 我要氧化亚氮燃油注入系统  - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.54,CHS,72,0,0,0,,今早我开到 时速140英里时就上不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:03.54,CHS,73,0,0,0,,业余的人不用氧化亚氮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.61,0:10:06.88,CHS,74,0,0,0,,我见过你开车 你的脚不够灵活
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:09.71,CHS,75,0,0,0,,- 如果不改  迟早会出事 - 给我一个这种装置
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:11.75,CHS,76,0,0,0,,要大的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.82,0:10:14.15,CHS,77,0,0,0,,等一下  给我两个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.76,CHS,78,0,0,0,,还有今晚我就要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:17.16,CHS,79,0,0,0,,还有今晚我就要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.89,0:11:31.09,CHS,80,0,0,0,,嘿  等一下 居然有个白小子出现
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:39.10,CHS,81,0,0,0,,喂  你的车都有什么装备
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:44.17,CHS,82,0,0,0,,- 想让我自己去发掘吗？ - 当然啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:47.81,CHS,83,0,0,0,,真勇敢  我叫海克特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:50.37,CHS,84,0,0,0,,我也有姓  但太难念  所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:51.94,CHS,85,0,0,0,,我是布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.61,CHS,86,0,0,0,,典型的白人名字 你懂我的意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.82,CHS,87,0,0,0,,你看到那边那辆车吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:02.69,CHS,88,0,0,0,,那是我的 不过今晚我不参加赛车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:04.82,CHS,89,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 因为我想参加正统赛车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:07.37,CHS,90,0,0,0,,我想参加劲爆拖车赛 你听过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:08.87,CHS,91,0,0,0,,当然听过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:12.03,CHS,92,0,0,0,,- 你想干什么？ - 我在等杜洛托
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:14.54,CHS,93,0,0,0,,大家都在等他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.61,0:12:17.70,CHS,94,0,0,0,,- 这是你的车？ - 是呀  我不正站在它旁边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:21.68,CHS,95,0,0,0,,妙得很 有几件事或许你还不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.84,CHS,96,0,0,0,,其中之一就是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:26.39,CHS,97,0,0,0,,你站不站在车旁不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:28.92,CHS,98,0,0,0,,重要的是你怎么赛车 老兄  最好搞清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:37.76,CHS,99,0,0,0,,喔  他们来了  要开始罗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:12:58.68,CHS,100,0,0,0,,- 唐  你好 - 嗨  卡美儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:00.69,CHS,101,0,0,0,,你在练瑜珈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.75,CHS,102,0,0,0,,真的呀？ 当然是真的  蒙妮卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:12.76,CHS,103,0,0,0,,我闻到一股狐骚味
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:17.03,CHS,104,0,0,0,,再不走 小心我在你们脸上留点记号
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.64,0:13:20.90,CHS,105,0,0,0,,- 莱蒂  我们只是聊聊天 - 是哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:23.10,CHS,106,0,0,0,,海克特
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:25.37,CHS,107,0,0,0,,老大  有什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:27.94,CHS,108,0,0,0,,- 怎么样？ - 艾德温
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:30.64,CHS,109,0,0,0,,- 今晚怎么比？ - 只赛一场
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:33.41,CHS,110,0,0,0,,赌注两千美金  赢的人全拿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:36.39,CHS,111,0,0,0,,- 海克特  你来管钱 - 为什么由海克特管钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.45,CHS,112,0,0,0,,他的车最慢 就算偷钱也跑不远
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:44.12,CHS,113,0,0,0,,- 祝你们好运 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:48.10,CHS,114,0,0,0,,我虽然没现金 但是我有车主证
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:51.80,CHS,115,0,0,0,,你以为会拳击 就是拳王阿里的对手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:54.77,CHS,116,0,0,0,,他知道我打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:56.93,CHS,117,0,0,0,,我有个提议
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:14:00.17,CHS,118,0,0,0,,谁赢我  我的车就是他的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:04.01,CHS,119,0,0,0,,但若我赢了  不但拿钱 也希望能赢得你们的尊敬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:05.42,CHS,120,0,0,0,,尊敬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:09.32,CHS,121,0,0,0,,对某些人来说尊敬蛮重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.82,CHS,122,0,0,0,,那是你的车？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:19.36,CHS,123,0,0,0,,这里有一个空气压缩器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.43,0:14:22.16,CHS,124,0,0,0,,一个氧化亚氮雾化系统 和四缸涡轮增压引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:24.36,CHS,125,0,0,0,,还有AlC控制器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:27.30,CHS,126,0,0,0,,直接接到氧化亚氮的喷气嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:31.21,CHS,127,0,0,0,,还有一个独立的燃料控制系统
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:34.66,CHS,128,0,0,0,,恐怕要花上一万块美金
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.61,CHS,129,0,0,0,,你看到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:41.84,CHS,130,0,0,0,,那么多的氧化亚氮 足够把他炸成碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.81,CHS,131,0,0,0,,你说我值不值？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:47.68,CHS,132,0,0,0,,现在还不知道 不过你可以参加比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.35,CHS,133,0,0,0,,咱们走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:57.22,CHS,134,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:01.23,CHS,135,0,0,0,,这条路不通  你另外找路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:02.89,CHS,136,0,0,0,,混蛋的飙车族
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:05.90,CHS,137,0,0,0,,注意  这里情况很紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.97,0:16:07.90,CHS,138,0,0,0,,他们把街道封锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.08,CHS,139,0,0,0,,艾德温
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:17:00.31,CHS,140,0,0,0,,不管你赢或输  我都是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.39,0:17:03.52,CHS,141,0,0,0,,但是如果你赢了  她也是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:14.33,CHS,142,0,0,0,,你一定会赢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:17.33,CHS,143,0,0,0,,我绝对会赢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:04.65,CHS,144,0,0,0,,接到报告 巴拉肯杂货店发生命案
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:07.78,CHS,145,0,0,0,,格兰岱尔发生命案 警察全部出动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:10.32,CHS,146,0,0,0,,我们可以开始了 我再重复一次  可以开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.39,0:18:12.33,CHS,147,0,0,0,,- 我们开始赛车吧 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:23.26,CHS,148,0,0,0,,出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:37.78,CHS,149,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.30,CHS,150,0,0,0,,天呀  那家伙可真快
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:06.60,CHS,151,0,0,0,,我们急起直追  “加油呀”！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:36.10,CHS,152,0,0,0,,完了  蒙妮卡泡汤啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:51.18,CHS,153,0,0,0,,(警告 危险！)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:53.16,CHS,154,0,0,0,,安静点！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.61,0:20:49.88,CHS,155,0,0,0,,加油呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.79,0:21:04.32,CHS,156,0,0,0,,- 你要的全在这里 - 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.56,CHS,157,0,0,0,,你在和一群小鬼头赛车嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:11.57,CHS,158,0,0,0,,把钱交给我妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.07,CHS,159,0,0,0,,你要数清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:17.01,CHS,160,0,0,0,,你就是我的奖品
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.81,0:21:21.80,CHS,161,0,0,0,,蒙妮卡宝贝  怎么样呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:24.32,CHS,162,0,0,0,,你有毛病吗  又没有赢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.65,0:21:28.25,CHS,163,0,0,0,,去你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:44.86,CHS,164,0,0,0,,- 你觉得好玩吗？ - 老弟  麻烦大了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:54.60,CHS,165,0,0,0,,- 你傻笑个什么劲 - 我几乎赢了你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:59.21,CHS,166,0,0,0,,你几乎赢我？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:02.88,CHS,167,0,0,0,,你没赢过我 连车也不是你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:08.92,CHS,168,0,0,0,,你换档时乱来一通 哪有那样踩双重离合器的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.99,0:22:13.43,CHS,169,0,0,0,,好在氧化亚氮 没把空气压缩器给烧掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:16.97,CHS,170,0,0,0,,居然敢说几乎赢我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:23.97,CHS,171,0,0,0,,现在我和我的天才科学家 得把这部车拆开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:26.88,CHS,172,0,0,0,,好把被你烧掉的活塞环给换掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:36.61,CHS,173,0,0,0,,你去问问 任何一位真正的赛车手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.69,0:22:40.15,CHS,174,0,0,0,,不管你是赢一英寸或一英里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:42.02,CHS,175,0,0,0,,赢就是赢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:52.03,CHS,176,0,0,0,,请注意  接到报告 在哈松区有飙车族在赛车…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:54.33,CHS,177,0,0,0,,要命！警察来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.41,0:22:55.67,CHS,178,0,0,0,,快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:10.28,CHS,179,0,0,0,,唐  上车  快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.87,0:24:34.93,CHS,180,0,0,0,,杜洛托  站住不准走！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.96,0:24:54.79,CHS,181,0,0,0,,上车！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.31,0:25:44.10,CHS,182,0,0,0,,没想到居然是你来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.68,0:25:49.04,CHS,183,0,0,0,,我想若能得到你的赏识 或许你会让我保留这部车
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.11,0:25:52.71,CHS,184,0,0,0,,你是得到我的赏识 可惜我还是要你的车
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.12,0:25:56.78,CHS,185,0,0,0,,你车开得不错 以前是开车的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.09,0:25:58.08,CHS,186,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.76,0:26:00.69,CHS,187,0,0,0,,那是偷车贼罗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.96,0:26:04.15,CHS,188,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 坐过牢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.23,0:26:07.46,CHS,189,0,0,0,,只进去过夜而已 没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.53,0:26:10.83,CHS,190,0,0,0,,你不是曾为了偷车 在感化院待过两年吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.54,0:26:15.77,CHS,191,0,0,0,,在图桑对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.84,0:26:19.57,CHS,192,0,0,0,,没错  我叫杰西去查你的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.64,0:26:23.88,CHS,193,0,0,0,,如今你可以在网站上 找到任何资料
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.95,0:26:25.88,CHS,194,0,0,0,,你何必去骗人？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.42,0:26:29.35,CHS,195,0,0,0,,那你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.29,0:26:33.52,CHS,196,0,0,0,,在隆波克坐了两年牢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.93,0:26:37.92,CHS,197,0,0,0,,我宁愿死也不要回去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.74,0:26:46.33,CHS,198,0,0,0,,- 真倒霉  - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.64,0:26:51.27,CHS,199,0,0,0,,今晚将是个漫长的一夜
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.31,0:26:56.91,CHS,200,0,0,0,,跟我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.42,0:27:08.19,CHS,201,0,0,0,,(哲学家孔子)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.57,0:27:49.93,CHS,202,0,0,0,,我们不是已达成协议了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.00,0:27:52.20,CHS,203,0,0,0,,你走你的路  我过我的桥
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.27,0:27:54.93,CHS,204,0,0,0,,大家都高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.01,0:27:57.10,CHS,205,0,0,0,,强尼  你要我怎么说呢 我们迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.18,0:28:00.61,CHS,206,0,0,0,,- 他是谁？ - 我新请的技工
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.68,0:28:02.37,CHS,207,0,0,0,,布莱恩  这位是强尼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.45,0:28:05.47,CHS,208,0,0,0,,穿蛇皮裤的那位是蓝斯 是他的表弟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:09.18,CHS,209,0,0,0,,什么时候能 和你那部本田2000赛车呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.25,0:28:11.95,CHS,210,0,0,0,,- 这是你的车  - 本来是我的  现在是他的了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.02,0:28:14.12,CHS,211,0,0,0,,不是  我还没有验收
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.96,0:28:19.33,CHS,212,0,0,0,,所以是无主的车罗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.40,0:28:21.80,CHS,213,0,0,0,,有人下了不少功夫嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.67,0:28:27.76,CHS,214,0,0,0,,- 蓝斯  你说呢？ - 看起来很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.84,0:28:29.60,CHS,215,0,0,0,,的确不错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.58,0:28:33.51,CHS,216,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.25,0:28:37.81,CHS,217,0,0,0,,下个月摩哈比沙漠见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.88,0:28:39.98,CHS,218,0,0,0,,你一定会输得屁滚尿流
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.98,0:28:41.78,CHS,219,0,0,0,,就凭这辆摩托车吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.85,0:28:43.88,CHS,220,0,0,0,,到时候你自然会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.73,0:28:59.20,CHS,221,0,0,0,,这又是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.27,0:29:02.20,CHS,222,0,0,0,,说来话长  以后再告诉你 我们快走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.07,0:29:31.50,CHS,223,0,0,0,,要爆炸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.45,0:29:46.14,CHS,224,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.22,0:29:47.88,CHS,225,0,0,0,,那是个很长的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.95,0:29:50.01,CHS,226,0,0,0,,反正有二十英里的路要走 你就慢慢说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.09,0:29:53.82,CHS,227,0,0,0,,一个变质的交易
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.89,0:29:56.95,CHS,228,0,0,0,,再加上我不应该和他妹妹上床
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.49,0:30:30.75,CHS,229,0,0,0,,嘿  布莱恩
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.33,0:30:33.76,CHS,230,0,0,0,,要喝啤酒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.63,0:30:37.22,CHS,231,0,0,0,,喔！糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.19,0:31:04.32,CHS,232,0,0,0,,我们全都落在后面  对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.39,0:31:06.83,CHS,233,0,0,0,,- 载着那些氧化亚氮 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.57,0:31:16.60,CHS,234,0,0,0,,唐  我们正想去找你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.15,0:31:25.64,CHS,235,0,0,0,,- 你到哪里去了？ - 那里有一大堆的警察
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.71,0:31:28.51,CHS,236,0,0,0,,他们像排练过的一样 从每个方向开进来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:31.08,CHS,237,0,0,0,,- 这是你的啤酒？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.12,0:31:36.11,CHS,238,0,0,0,,我的大天才  带她到楼上去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.13,0:31:39.29,CHS,239,0,0,0,,穿着衣服怎么享受嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.30,0:31:42.29,CHS,240,0,0,0,,连这种小事也搞不定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.36,0:31:43.80,CHS,241,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.67,0:31:47.29,CHS,242,0,0,0,,你看我像没事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.37,0:31:49.36,CHS,243,0,0,0,,我只不过问问罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.11,0:31:55.27,CHS,244,0,0,0,,唐  你把那菜鸟带来这里干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.34,0:31:57.34,CHS,245,0,0,0,,因为那个菜鸟救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.41,0:32:00.18,CHS,246,0,0,0,,他没有忙着逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.25,0:32:02.72,CHS,247,0,0,0,,是他带我回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.76,0:32:12.16,CHS,248,0,0,0,,只要是可乐娜  啤酒随你喝
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.23,0:32:15.25,CHS,249,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 那瓶是文斯的  好好享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.73,0:32:17.70,CHS,250,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.24,0:32:27.17,CHS,251,0,0,0,,老大  厕所在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.24,0:32:29.87,CHS,252,0,0,0,,楼上右边第一间
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.29,0:32:47.23,CHS,253,0,0,0,,他没资格来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.30,0:32:50.03,CHS,254,0,0,0,,- 你对他一点也不了解 - 唐  他说的不错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.10,0:32:52.80,CHS,255,0,0,0,,文斯 别忘了当初我也不了解你呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.87,0:32:55.36,CHS,256,0,0,0,,拜托那时候我们才小学三年级
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.81,0:32:59.97,CHS,257,0,0,0,,那些女人是你找来的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.04,0:33:02.88,CHS,258,0,0,0,,- 什么样的都有  要我的吗？ - 你最好闭上…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.18,0:33:06.81,CHS,259,0,0,0,,- 你什么都没有 - 你看起来有点累
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.88,0:33:08.94,CHS,260,0,0,0,,最好到楼上去替我按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.02,0:33:10.61,CHS,261,0,0,0,,可是这些客人怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.69,0:33:13.95,CHS,262,0,0,0,,那就到楼上去由你替我按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.56,0:33:17.99,CHS,263,0,0,0,,疯女人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.53,0:33:28.47,CHS,264,0,0,0,,记住你还欠我一部十秒内 能跑四分之一英里的极速车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.71,0:33:31.14,CHS,265,0,0,0,,哎哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.77,0:33:34.54,CHS,266,0,0,0,,有他好看的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.18,0:33:41.15,CHS,267,0,0,0,,马桶座垫你有擦干净吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.72,0:33:47.48,CHS,268,0,0,0,,好啦  你别惹事好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:48.99,CHS,269,0,0,0,,别这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.46,0:33:53.12,CHS,270,0,0,0,,走  替我拿点饮料
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.26,0:33:56.20,CHS,271,0,0,0,,别走嘛 我们正在渐渐进入情况
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.04,0:34:05.87,CHS,272,0,0,0,,- 你要哪种饮料 - 只要是冰的都行
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.11,0:34:10.10,CHS,273,0,0,0,,我哥哥喜欢你 通常他谁也不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.18,0:34:12.74,CHS,274,0,0,0,,对  他蛮难懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.81,0:34:14.75,CHS,275,0,0,0,,是吗？那你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:20.22,CHS,276,0,0,0,,- 我简单多了 - 你连撒谎都不会
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.39,0:34:23.82,CHS,277,0,0,0,,我认为那是恭维
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.39,0:34:28.06,CHS,278,0,0,0,,- 现在有个问题 - 什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.13,0:34:30.86,CHS,279,0,0,0,,你得好好去睡一觉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.93,0:34:35.30,CHS,280,0,0,0,,而且肯定需要洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.37,0:34:38.10,CHS,281,0,0,0,,走  我送你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.93,0:35:03.26,CHS,282,0,0,0,,把手伸出来  很好 现在把车门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:06.93,CHS,283,0,0,0,,把手放在头后 放在你头后
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.00,0:35:10.70,CHS,284,0,0,0,,面向车子  向后倒退到车尾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.77,0:35:13.90,CHS,285,0,0,0,,向右走两步  停在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.18,0:35:18.61,CHS,286,0,0,0,,我做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.68,0:35:21.62,CHS,287,0,0,0,,闭嘴 警官  他没武器
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.93,0:35:34.56,CHS,288,0,0,0,,慕斯  拜托你把手铐拿掉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.63,0:35:37.16,CHS,289,0,0,0,,- 要命  弄得那么紧 - 要玩就玩真的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.23,0:35:44.94,CHS,290,0,0,0,,- 玩真的 - 否则万一被人看到就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.94,0:35:48.40,CHS,291,0,0,0,,真漂亮 比上次被充公的房子要好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.47,0:35:52.71,CHS,292,0,0,0,,这是艾迪费雪在五零年代 替伊丽莎白泰勒盖的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.78,0:35:55.41,CHS,293,0,0,0,,连好莱坞的警察都有明星架势
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.59,0:36:02.45,CHS,294,0,0,0,,才把他从 杜洛托极速车天堂带过来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.52,0:36:04.46,CHS,295,0,0,0,,那可是部八万美金的车子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.52,0:36:08.12,CHS,296,0,0,0,,- 等等  你告诉他了吗？ - 他早就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.19,0:36:11.56,CHS,297,0,0,0,,- 最好把帐单交给强尼 - 你居然跟我耍嘴皮子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.63,0:36:14.83,CHS,298,0,0,0,,这会影响到 警方和FBl之间的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.90,0:36:17.99,CHS,299,0,0,0,,- 我一走进来  他就… - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.07,0:36:20.30,CHS,300,0,0,0,,我们慢慢谈  好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.37,0:36:23.67,CHS,301,0,0,0,,慕斯 请你给我们四杯冰卡布其诺
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.74,0:36:26.44,CHS,302,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 要普通的还是低咖啡因的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.95,0:36:29.57,CHS,303,0,0,0,,低咖啡因的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.65,0:36:32.52,CHS,304,0,0,0,,两个月内有四件抢劫案 我们一点线索都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.52,0:36:35.59,CHS,305,0,0,0,,单是DVD放映机 和数位照相机就值一、两百万
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.65,0:36:38.28,CHS,306,0,0,0,,加起来总值超过六百万美金
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:41.49,CHS,307,0,0,0,,我们的官方压力非常大
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.56,0:36:43.69,CHS,308,0,0,0,,所以才让你去卧底
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.76,0:36:47.66,CHS,309,0,0,0,,告诉你一件事 若你能帮我们结案
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.73,0:36:51.10,CHS,310,0,0,0,,升官这件事就包在FBl身上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.24,0:36:55.26,CHS,311,0,0,0,,- 卡车司机是怎么说的？ - 他给我们同样的描述
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.34,0:36:57.54,CHS,312,0,0,0,,一共三辆本田喜美 驾驶技术高超
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.61,0:37:00.77,CHS,313,0,0,0,,车身底盘有绿色霓虹灯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.85,0:37:03.44,CHS,314,0,0,0,,根据化验室的报告 刹车痕全都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.52,0:37:05.45,CHS,315,0,0,0,,是藤原正统ZX轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.52,0:37:08.01,CHS,316,0,0,0,,所以一定是那些极速车
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.09,0:37:10.15,CHS,317,0,0,0,,我们若不能尽快解决
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.22,0:37:12.62,CHS,318,0,0,0,,卡车司机们 就会自己采取激烈的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.69,0:37:15.32,CHS,319,0,0,0,,我告诉他们已经快结案了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.39,0:37:17.33,CHS,320,0,0,0,,难道你要我变成说谎的人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:19.33,CHS,321,0,0,0,,先看看我们已有的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.40,0:37:22.06,CHS,322,0,0,0,,我们都知道这和杜洛托有关
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.13,0:37:25.07,CHS,323,0,0,0,,虽然不见得是他亲自下的手
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.14,0:37:27.87,CHS,324,0,0,0,,但我保证他绝对知道是谁干的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.94,0:37:30.24,CHS,325,0,0,0,,- 我需要时间… - 你需要时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.31,0:37:33.84,CHS,326,0,0,0,,我们已经没有时间啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.11,0:37:37.31,CHS,327,0,0,0,,尽快给我一些可以用的资料
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.48,0:37:40.51,CHS,328,0,0,0,,哈瑞有没有好好合作？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.59,0:37:44.42,CHS,329,0,0,0,,有  否则就叫他为收购赃物 到牢里去蹲个三、五年
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.49,0:37:46.48,CHS,330,0,0,0,,他对杜洛托有什么评语
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.56,0:37:49.62,CHS,331,0,0,0,,他很怕他  可是不认为 杜洛托会在闲虾时去抢卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.70,0:37:52.13,CHS,332,0,0,0,,- 因为杜洛托很有自制力 - 等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.20,0:37:55.39,CHS,333,0,0,0,,不是我不相信哈瑞的观察力
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.47,0:37:59.27,CHS,334,0,0,0,,但当初杜洛托 是因为差点打死人才去坐牢的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.34,0:38:02.10,CHS,335,0,0,0,,他血液里充满了氧化亚氮 脑袋里则充满了汽油
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.17,0:38:04.11,CHS,336,0,0,0,,他绝非善类
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.18,0:38:06.41,CHS,337,0,0,0,,泰勒  我还需要一部车
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.41,0:38:07.38,CHS,338,0,0,0,,泰勒  我还需要一部车
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.65,0:38:13.08,CHS,339,0,0,0,,那零件和服务怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.15,0:38:15.24,CHS,340,0,0,0,,- 先拖延一下 - 我真不知道该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.86,0:38:22.22,CHS,341,0,0,0,,在搞什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.29,0:38:24.23,CHS,342,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.30,0:38:27.73,CHS,343,0,0,0,,- 你的车呀 - 我的车？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.80,0:38:31.26,CHS,344,0,0,0,,我要的是 十秒能跑四分之一英里的车
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.34,0:38:35.40,CHS,345,0,0,0,,这家伙只能用推的 或用拖车拖过终点线
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.71,0:38:38.90,CHS,346,0,0,0,,恐怕连拖都拖不过终点
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.35,0:38:41.44,CHS,347,0,0,0,,这么没信心呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.51,0:38:44.11,CHS,348,0,0,0,,我对你有信心 对这堆垃圾可没有
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.18,0:38:46.41,CHS,349,0,0,0,,- 我们这里是汽车修理厂 - 把车盖打开
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.49,0:38:48.25,CHS,350,0,0,0,,- 把车盖打开？ - 对  打开它
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.89,0:38:52.32,CHS,351,0,0,0,,哇！2JZ引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.39,0:38:55.09,CHS,352,0,0,0,,- 这么厉害 - 我不是早就告诉你了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.16,0:38:57.49,CHS,353,0,0,0,,- 我收回刚刚说的话 - 依我看
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.56,0:39:02.19,CHS,354,0,0,0,,如果投资一万五 若需要隔夜送到的日本零件时
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.27,0:39:05.67,CHS,355,0,0,0,,可能要花更多的钱 但保证能打败所有的跑车
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.74,0:39:08.04,CHS,356,0,0,0,,叫哈瑞先记在我的帐上好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.11,0:39:09.54,CHS,357,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.61,0:39:13.77,CHS,358,0,0,0,,我得让你再去参加赛车 好从你身上赚上一笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.85,0:39:17.84,CHS,359,0,0,0,,你就去参加在加州 摩哈比沙漠举行的极速大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.42,0:39:22.65,CHS,360,0,0,0,,以后你下班后就过来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.72,0:39:26.92,CHS,361,0,0,0,,如果在这里 还找不到顺手工具的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.99,0:39:27.99,CHS,362,0,0,0,,那你根本没资格拥有车子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.99,0:39:29.19,CHS,363,0,0,0,,那你根本没资格拥有车子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.10,0:39:35.03,CHS,364,0,0,0,,你是他的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.76,0:40:01.99,CHS,365,0,0,0,,告诉我你的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.99,0:40:04.18,CHS,366,0,0,0,,换成可调整的哥尼牌避震器
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.26,0:40:06.49,CHS,367,0,0,0,,就能帮我减少两磅的重量
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.56,0:40:09.96,CHS,368,0,0,0,,而且还能增加车轮的防滑性能
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.03,0:40:11.73,CHS,369,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.80,0:40:14.20,CHS,370,0,0,0,,这是这部车的基本设计
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.27,0:40:18.80,CHS,371,0,0,0,,而那就是整理好后的成品
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.87,0:40:20.81,CHS,372,0,0,0,,红绿相间
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.88,0:40:23.00,CHS,373,0,0,0,,天呐  你该进麻省理工学院
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.08,0:40:25.01,CHS,374,0,0,0,,想得美
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:27.98,CHS,375,0,0,0,,我得了…他们叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.05,0:40:32.21,CHS,376,0,0,0,,- 就是注意力无法集中… - 所谓的ADD
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.29,0:40:34.98,CHS,377,0,0,0,,对  就是那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.19,0:40:39.02,CHS,378,0,0,0,,其实我的代数很好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.09,0:40:40.75,CHS,379,0,0,0,,也很喜欢数学
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.83,0:40:42.82,CHS,380,0,0,0,,可惜其他科目全都一塌糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.90,0:40:45.76,CHS,381,0,0,0,,最后惨遭退学
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.83,0:40:48.96,CHS,382,0,0,0,,但是不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.04,0:40:52.84,CHS,383,0,0,0,,只有引擎能够使我平静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.59,0:41:15.59,CHS,384,0,0,0,,- 我走了 - 别这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.66,0:41:18.36,CHS,385,0,0,0,,文斯  来这边帮我们一下
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.43,0:41:20.76,CHS,386,0,0,0,,老大  你根本不缺帮手嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.35,0:41:36.54,CHS,387,0,0,0,,- 蜜雅！ - 来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.62,0:41:39.92,CHS,388,0,0,0,,- 鸡肉都烤干了 - 我马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.19,0:41:48.59,CHS,389,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.66,0:41:51.83,CHS,390,0,0,0,,因为你是所有人中
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.90,0:41:54.77,CHS,391,0,0,0,,第一个拿烤鸡的 所以由你说祈祷文
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.31,0:42:02.28,CHS,392,0,0,0,,亲爱的神圣的…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.34,0:42:03.78,CHS,393,0,0,0,,圣灵
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.84,0:42:05.78,CHS,394,0,0,0,,圣灵  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.85,0:42:09.94,CHS,395,0,0,0,,嗯  谢谢你供应给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.02,0:42:11.95,CHS,396,0,0,0,,氧化亚氮喷气嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.02,0:42:16.98,CHS,397,0,0,0,,还有进气冷却器 和滚珠轴承涡轮增压器
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.06,0:42:20.19,CHS,398,0,0,0,,还有  嗯  镀钛活门弹簧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.26,0:42:22.13,CHS,399,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 阿门
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.20,0:42:24.76,CHS,400,0,0,0,,- 很不错 - 阿门
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.83,0:42:28.10,CHS,401,0,0,0,,他根本是在向车神祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.10,0:42:31.44,CHS,402,0,0,0,,- 这些烤鸡真好吃 - 你要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.24,0:42:33.80,CHS,403,0,0,0,,- 练习呀 - 谢谢你  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.87,0:42:35.50,CHS,404,0,0,0,,看是谁回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.58,0:42:37.34,CHS,405,0,0,0,,咱们的老朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.41,0:42:39.54,CHS,406,0,0,0,,我还以为你不饿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.68,0:42:42.98,CHS,407,0,0,0,,- 总得吃东西嘛 - 他永远吃不饱
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.05,0:42:44.81,CHS,408,0,0,0,,好  快坐下来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.79,0:42:54.73,CHS,409,0,0,0,,蜜雅  你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.61,0:43:08.67,CHS,410,0,0,0,,- 杰西  把烤鸡给我 - 让咱们吃个够
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.74,0:43:19.45,CHS,411,0,0,0,,- 还要不要再来点烤鸡？ - 有没有租录影带？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.45,0:43:20.89,CHS,412,0,0,0,,你需要帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.95,0:43:24.86,CHS,413,0,0,0,,不用了 你去和他们一起看录影带吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.92,0:43:27.36,CHS,414,0,0,0,,在我家是不让厨子善后的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.43,0:43:28.89,CHS,415,0,0,0,,那我真希望能去那里
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.67,0:43:35.60,CHS,416,0,0,0,,其实我们应该出去走走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.67,0:43:37.86,CHS,417,0,0,0,,我不和我哥哥的朋友约会
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.97,0:43:40.53,CHS,418,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.61,0:43:43.60,CHS,419,0,0,0,,- 看来我得踢他几脚 - 那我倒想看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.68,0:43:47.44,CHS,420,0,0,0,,就算要付钱我也心甘情愿
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.93,0:44:02.86,CHS,421,0,0,0,,你忙完后就去替我洗车
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.93,0:44:05.19,CHS,422,0,0,0,,- 你是什么意思？ - 蜜雅  我不是说你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.26,0:44:07.76,CHS,423,0,0,0,,我是指那个讨厌鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.83,0:44:10.27,CHS,424,0,0,0,,还有把你最好的洋装穿上
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.34,0:44:13.13,CHS,425,0,0,0,,因为等洗完车后你就该去接客了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.28,0:44:18.30,CHS,426,0,0,0,,这个微波炉坏了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.38,0:44:20.40,CHS,427,0,0,0,,到底是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.61,0:44:25.64,CHS,428,0,0,0,,文斯  你要带我去的 那家古巴餐厅叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.72,0:44:27.81,CHS,429,0,0,0,,就是那间很有特色的餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.89,0:44:31.12,CHS,430,0,0,0,,- 有木头桌子上面放着红蜡烛 - 对  还有芭蕉树
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.19,0:44:33.72,CHS,431,0,0,0,,- 那家叫什么名字？ - 叫恰恰恰餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.79,0:44:35.42,CHS,432,0,0,0,,对  就是那家
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.80,0:44:38.82,CHS,433,0,0,0,,你可以带我去那里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.90,0:44:42.06,CHS,434,0,0,0,,星期五晚上十点  可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.13,0:44:45.47,CHS,435,0,0,0,,- 绝对没问题 - 那好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.68,0:44:54.61,CHS,436,0,0,0,,- 怎么没有爆米花 - 要吃自己去做
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.56,0:45:11.16,CHS,437,0,0,0,,好啦 这比代客泊车还方便
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.17,0:45:17.00,CHS,438,0,0,0,,- 哈瑞 - 你最近好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.07,0:45:19.30,CHS,439,0,0,0,,托你的福  很好  快请进
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.37,0:45:21.93,CHS,440,0,0,0,,- 这些货你看喜不喜欢 - 这位又是谁呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.38,0:45:26.44,CHS,441,0,0,0,,- 新雇的帮手吗？ - 少挖苦我了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.51,0:45:28.57,CHS,442,0,0,0,,- 海克特  近来好吗？ - 你怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.65,0:45:31.05,CHS,443,0,0,0,,很好  你需要些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.12,0:45:35.05,CHS,444,0,0,0,,你帮我照着这张单子找 每样要三个
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.86,0:45:39.12,CHS,445,0,0,0,,你先看看
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.19,0:45:41.72,CHS,446,0,0,0,,- 什么时候要？ - 明天  今天也行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.79,0:45:43.23,CHS,447,0,0,0,,- 现在更好 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.30,0:45:46.32,CHS,448,0,0,0,,白小子动作蛮快的 贝多  把钱给我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.43,0:45:50.16,CHS,449,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.60,0:45:54.30,CHS,450,0,0,0,,“本田喜美” 你说每样要三个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.37,0:45:56.18,CHS,451,0,0,0,,对  每样要三个  有办法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.18,0:45:57.73,CHS,452,0,0,0,,对  每样要三个  有办法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.81,0:46:00.14,CHS,453,0,0,0,,你先看我手里的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.24,0:48:09.17,CHS,454,0,0,0,,他连呻吟都像警察
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.08,0:48:20.07,CHS,455,0,0,0,,布莱恩  这是关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.15,0:48:22.68,CHS,456,0,0,0,,要非常注意你所说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.75,0:48:25.15,CHS,457,0,0,0,,如果懂的话就点头
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.22,0:48:26.85,CHS,458,0,0,0,,快点头！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.06,0:48:29.72,CHS,459,0,0,0,,坐起来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.10,0:48:38.40,CHS,460,0,0,0,,你到这里来干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.47,0:48:41.60,CHS,461,0,0,0,,我之所以来这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.71,0:48:50.01,CHS,462,0,0,0,,是因为我还欠你一部极速跑车
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.55,0:48:55.01,CHS,463,0,0,0,,并且和极速大赛有关
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.32,0:48:59.45,CHS,464,0,0,0,,我在里面发现
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.52,0:49:05.26,CHS,465,0,0,0,,海克特有三部本田喜美 而且装上史普恩牌的引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.33,0:49:08.09,CHS,466,0,0,0,,除此之外  他还到哈瑞那里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.16,0:49:11.87,CHS,467,0,0,0,,订购三个T66涡轮压缩引擎 加上氧化亚氮燃料注入器
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.87,0:49:16.10,CHS,468,0,0,0,,和莫德克牌电脑控制系统
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.01,0:49:20.94,CHS,469,0,0,0,,照你这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.65,0:49:25.41,CHS,470,0,0,0,,你要偷进每个人的车库里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.48,0:49:27.45,CHS,471,0,0,0,,去查他们将要开什么车吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.82,0:49:30.75,CHS,472,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.69,0:49:36.68,CHS,473,0,0,0,,因为老大  你是知道的…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.76,0:49:38.69,CHS,474,0,0,0,,我不能再输了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.13,0:49:42.19,CHS,475,0,0,0,,他是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.47,0:49:45.13,CHS,476,0,0,0,,一定是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.47,0:49:50.80,CHS,477,0,0,0,,你是警察吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.21,0:49:58.27,CHS,478,0,0,0,,咱们出去逛逛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.18,0:50:02.62,CHS,479,0,0,0,,走呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.74,0:50:23.67,CHS,480,0,0,0,,杰西  你守在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.30,0:50:55.50,CHS,481,0,0,0,,喂  老大
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.74,0:50:59.67,CHS,482,0,0,0,,全都没有引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.74,0:51:03.34,CHS,483,0,0,0,,那他们拿什么来比赛？ 希望和梦想吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.41,0:51:05.78,CHS,484,0,0,0,,不知道 我只知道他们狡猾得很
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.85,0:51:08.18,CHS,485,0,0,0,,而且钱也不是问题
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.02,0:51:14.96,CHS,486,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.43,0:51:25.49,CHS,487,0,0,0,,唐  他们来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.57,0:51:29.53,CHS,488,0,0,0,,强尼和他那伙人 朝你那里去了  速度很快
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.61,0:51:31.23,CHS,489,0,0,0,,有人来了  快躲
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.31,0:51:33.14,CHS,490,0,0,0,,布莱恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.57,0:52:00.66,CHS,491,0,0,0,,走  快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.74,0:52:02.60,CHS,492,0,0,0,,泰德  让我问你一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.67,0:52:07.27,CHS,493,0,0,0,,你有没有看出那里不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.38,0:52:08.37,CHS,494,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.88,0:52:14.25,CHS,495,0,0,0,,- 这里有没有引擎？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.32,0:52:16.08,CHS,496,0,0,0,,- 有没有？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.52,0:52:22.75,CHS,497,0,0,0,,不是说在极速大赛前一个礼拜 就能拿到日产SR-20的引擎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.83,0:52:24.59,CHS,498,0,0,0,,有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.66,0:52:28.10,CHS,499,0,0,0,,你真会讲话 或许是太会讲话了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.33,0:52:31.27,CHS,500,0,0,0,,蓝斯  你觉得哪种好？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.67,0:52:34.73,CHS,501,0,0,0,,密度四十的机油？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.80,0:52:36.74,CHS,502,0,0,0,,还是密度五十的机油？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.81,0:52:38.74,CHS,503,0,0,0,,四十的应该不错
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.36,0:52:57.45,CHS,504,0,0,0,,它们到底在哪里？ 你最好说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.53,0:52:59.05,CHS,505,0,0,0,,- 够了！ - 它们在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.13,0:53:01.15,CHS,506,0,0,0,,在仓库里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.23,0:53:03.10,CHS,507,0,0,0,,它们在仓库里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.32,0:53:21.85,CHS,508,0,0,0,,泰德  过来亲我的鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.60,0:53:37.46,CHS,509,0,0,0,,咱们去拿引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.53,0:53:40.30,CHS,510,0,0,0,,后天我的上司 会从华盛顿到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.37,0:53:43.07,CHS,511,0,0,0,,我一定得拿些成果给他看 到现在为止我们手上的资料是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.14,0:53:45.57,CHS,512,0,0,0,,一个嘴塞润滑剂管 油嘴滑舌的人  一些自动武器
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.64,0:53:48.27,CHS,513,0,0,0,,一群亚裔帮派
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.34,0:53:51.64,CHS,514,0,0,0,,满满一车库的DVD放映机 还有一堆发疯的行为
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.71,0:53:55.12,CHS,515,0,0,0,,何不先向强尼下手 等尘埃落定后再决定下一步
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.18,0:53:58.21,CHS,516,0,0,0,,因为我们只掌握到情况 并没有有力的证据
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.29,0:54:00.19,CHS,517,0,0,0,,我们手上所有的 都不是主要的证据
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.26,0:54:01.95,CHS,518,0,0,0,,我们已经知道动机
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.03,0:54:06.03,CHS,519,0,0,0,,和卡车司机准备自己组织 对抗暴力的自卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.10,0:54:08.16,CHS,520,0,0,0,,告诉我们海克特这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.16,0:54:10.16,CHS,521,0,0,0,,他是拉丁人  一个小角色
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.23,0:54:12.46,CHS,522,0,0,0,,他仍在替车子装引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.54,0:54:14.16,CHS,523,0,0,0,,但是轮胎不合
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.24,0:54:15.83,CHS,524,0,0,0,,谁有香烟  给我一根
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.91,0:54:18.20,CHS,525,0,0,0,,- 快给他一根香烟 - 别给他香烟
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.27,0:54:19.83,CHS,526,0,0,0,,- 你不是戒烟了吗 - 是戒了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.91,0:54:21.50,CHS,527,0,0,0,,- 给我一根烟行不行 - 快给他香烟
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.58,0:54:22.24,CHS,528,0,0,0,,别给他
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.25,0:54:29.78,CHS,529,0,0,0,,- 杜洛托这个人呢？ - 他不像会做这种疯狂事情的人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.85,0:54:32.15,CHS,530,0,0,0,,他应该不会做这种 自杀式的卡车抢劫行为
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.22,0:54:34.49,CHS,531,0,0,0,,文斯也许会做 但他不够聪明去策划它
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.56,0:54:37.82,CHS,532,0,0,0,,我想那家伙的妹妹 蒙住了你的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.89,0:54:39.42,CHS,533,0,0,0,,- 你是什么意思？ - 我不怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.50,0:54:42.33,CHS,534,0,0,0,,监视她也是我的一大享受
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.13,0:54:49.13,CHS,535,0,0,0,,别打了  你也喜欢动粗了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.41,0:54:57.04,CHS,536,0,0,0,,你最近看过杜洛托的档案吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.11,0:54:59.55,CHS,537,0,0,0,,- 我已经全都记住了 - 再看一遍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.62,0:55:01.64,CHS,538,0,0,0,,你最好看看这些资料
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.95,0:55:06.72,CHS,539,0,0,0,,记得我曾经告诉过你 他几乎打死一个人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.59,0:55:11.08,CHS,540,0,0,0,,他是用三分之四英寸的扭力板手 打伤那个人的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.16,0:55:14.39,CHS,541,0,0,0,,这就是他的典型自我控制力
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.50,0:55:18.43,CHS,542,0,0,0,,再给我几天时间
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.80,0:55:21.77,CHS,543,0,0,0,,我还需要几天时间
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.77,0:55:22.74,CHS,544,0,0,0,,我还需要几天时间
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.01,0:55:31.95,CHS,545,0,0,0,,它将会从下向上卷
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.01,0:55:34.21,CHS,546,0,0,0,,我把最大操纵压力设在24
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.89,0:55:39.75,CHS,547,0,0,0,,听说你今晚有个大计划？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.99,0:55:44.55,CHS,548,0,0,0,,对  我邀蜜雅去吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.63,0:55:47.46,CHS,549,0,0,0,,你若伤她的心 我就扭断你的脖子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.83,0:55:51.36,CHS,550,0,0,0,,那种事绝对不会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.54,0:55:57.17,CHS,551,0,0,0,,我给你看样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.48,0:56:08.92,CHS,552,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.55,0:56:13.08,CHS,553,0,0,0,,是我和我爸爸改装的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.09,0:56:19.59,CHS,554,0,0,0,,九百马力的大马力跑车 它是个野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.66,0:56:22.46,CHS,555,0,0,0,,- 你知道她在棕榈谷跑多快吗？ - 多快？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.53,0:56:24.36,CHS,556,0,0,0,,九秒跑四分之一英里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.74,0:56:28.03,CHS,557,0,0,0,,- 天呀 - 是我爸爸在开
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.10,0:56:32.54,CHS,558,0,0,0,,扭力是那么的强 车身的底盘差点就脱离了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.64,0:56:36.17,CHS,559,0,0,0,,而且非常难控制她
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.25,0:56:39.21,CHS,560,0,0,0,,- 那你能开多快？ - 我从来没开过
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.28,0:56:40.37,CHS,561,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.19,0:56:45.42,CHS,562,0,0,0,,因为她让我害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.56,0:56:53.33,CHS,563,0,0,0,,那是我爸爸 当时他参加职业改装车大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.40,0:56:55.06,CHS,564,0,0,0,,是那一季的最后一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.87,0:57:01.20,CHS,565,0,0,0,,一个叫肯尼的家伙 在最后转弯时从内线冲出来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.27,0:57:04.57,CHS,566,0,0,0,,碰到他的保险杠 让他在时速120时失控撞墙
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.91,0:57:10.74,CHS,567,0,0,0,,我亲眼看着我爸爸被烧死
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.82,0:57:15.31,CHS,568,0,0,0,,我还记得他的呼喊声
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.12,0:57:22.75,CHS,569,0,0,0,,那里的人说 在油箱着火前他已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.03,0:57:31.97,CHS,570,0,0,0,,而喊叫声是出自于我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.90,0:57:37.53,CHS,571,0,0,0,,事后大约一个星期我看到肯尼
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.61,0:57:42.41,CHS,572,0,0,0,,手上刚好有个扳手 就用它去揍他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.48,0:57:44.24,CHS,573,0,0,0,,我并无意拼命的打他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.31,0:57:47.61,CHS,574,0,0,0,,但当我停下来时 手臂连举都举不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.56,0:57:54.99,CHS,575,0,0,0,,他在中学里做工友
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.06,0:57:58.65,CHS,576,0,0,0,,每天搭巴士上下班
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.73,0:58:03.13,CHS,577,0,0,0,,从此以后 他们不准我参加任何赛车比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.10,0:58:10.60,CHS,578,0,0,0,,如今我是今朝有酒今朝醉
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.44,0:58:15.17,CHS,579,0,0,0,,其他都无关紧要
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.24,0:58:18.34,CHS,580,0,0,0,,什么贷款、店的生意 和我的那帮人  全都不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.55,0:58:22.07,CHS,581,0,0,0,,只有赛车时的短短十秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.55,0:58:25.28,CHS,582,0,0,0,,刹那间我彻底的解脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.54,0:58:48.94,CHS,583,0,0,0,,这个帮派是怎么组成的？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.01,0:58:50.24,CHS,584,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 这个帮派
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.31,0:58:52.87,CHS,585,0,0,0,,他们不把它叫做帮派
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.95,0:58:55.11,CHS,586,0,0,0,,- 那该怎么称呼呢？ - 他们称之为团队
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.18,0:58:58.71,CHS,587,0,0,0,,- 他们叫自己为团队 - 这个团队是怎么组成的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.69,0:59:01.85,CHS,588,0,0,0,,说来话长
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.09,0:59:05.42,CHS,589,0,0,0,,我有的是时间
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.49,0:59:07.76,CHS,590,0,0,0,,文斯和我哥哥一起长大
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.83,0:59:11.03,CHS,591,0,0,0,,可惜他一直不成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.67,0:59:15.90,CHS,592,0,0,0,,他们从小就是朋友 至于莱蒂是我们的邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.97,0:59:19.27,CHS,593,0,0,0,,早在她十岁时就对车子着迷了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.34,0:59:23.47,CHS,594,0,0,0,,所以我哥哥自然引起她的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.55,0:59:27.68,CHS,595,0,0,0,,- 当她十六岁时… - 她却引起你哥哥的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.75,0:59:31.41,CHS,596,0,0,0,,对  这种事是不是很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.49,0:59:32.42,CHS,597,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.16,0:59:38.25,CHS,598,0,0,0,,杰西又是怎么加进来的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.46,0:59:42.33,CHS,599,0,0,0,,杰西和李昂这两个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.40,0:59:44.09,CHS,600,0,0,0,,有天突然出现后就不走了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.70,0:59:47.53,CHS,601,0,0,0,,其实这和我哥哥有关 他像是…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.27,0:59:51.21,CHS,602,0,0,0,,他像是一块磁铁
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.34,0:59:54.57,CHS,603,0,0,0,,把大家都吸引进来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.25,0:59:57.91,CHS,604,0,0,0,,你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.92,1:00:02.11,CHS,605,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.12,1:00:05.88,CHS,606,0,0,0,,吸引我的是你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.96,1:00:08.29,CHS,607,0,0,0,,和你哥哥做朋友是额外的奖金
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.66,1:00:13.25,CHS,608,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.13,1:00:19.03,CHS,609,0,0,0,,偶尔能排在第一位 感觉上倒是很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.44,1:00:23.93,CHS,610,0,0,0,,我们去兜风好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.98,1:01:04.17,CHS,611,0,0,0,,- 喂？ - 又发生抢案了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.25,1:01:06.74,CHS,612,0,0,0,,比金已经决定在下午五点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.82,1:01:11.34,CHS,613,0,0,0,,向强尼和他的手下动手 除非你有异议
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.42,1:01:14.12,CHS,614,0,0,0,,如果同意就说“是”
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.19,1:01:16.28,CHS,615,0,0,0,,- 是 - 那是谁呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.03,1:01:19.96,CHS,616,0,0,0,,打错号码的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.13,1:04:14.15,CHS,618,0,0,0,,是的  长官  我知道  可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.23,1:04:16.93,CHS,619,0,0,0,,是…长官
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.00,1:04:18.99,CHS,620,0,0,0,,是的  我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.27,1:04:25.24,CHS,621,0,0,0,,DVD放映机都是合法购买的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.31,1:04:28.44,CHS,622,0,0,0,,我们只能告强尼和他的党羽 非法持有武器
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.51,1:04:31.04,CHS,623,0,0,0,,和几张超速罚单而已
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.11,1:04:35.52,CHS,624,0,0,0,,- 所以他们都出狱罗 - 是他爸爸来保释他们的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.58,1:04:38.68,CHS,625,0,0,0,,奥康纳 你的智商只有这么一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.03,1:04:47.15,CHS,626,0,0,0,,- 你想怨到我头上 - 我想怨谁就怨谁
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.23,1:04:50.46,CHS,627,0,0,0,,- 这是我的权力 - 你根本怨不到我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.53,1:04:52.12,CHS,628,0,0,0,,安静点  你最好听清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.20,1:04:53.96,CHS,629,0,0,0,,不管你用什么方法
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.04,1:04:56.47,CHS,630,0,0,0,,就算暴露身份我也不在乎
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.54,1:04:59.03,CHS,631,0,0,0,,限你在36小时内把案子了结
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.11,1:05:01.63,CHS,632,0,0,0,,否则请你另就高明
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.32,1:05:16.78,CHS,633,0,0,0,,是杜洛托  绝对是杜洛托
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.09,1:05:21.89,CHS,634,0,0,0,,强尼和海克特只是烟雾而已
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.33,1:05:28.06,CHS,635,0,0,0,,我知道你一直在骗我 问题是
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.14,1:05:30.83,CHS,636,0,0,0,,你有没有因为 蜜雅的关系也在骗自己
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.51,1:05:37.38,CHS,637,0,0,0,,他绝不愿意再回牢里去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.45,1:05:40.35,CHS,638,0,0,0,,坐不坐牢要他自己去决定
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.49,1:05:46.78,CHS,639,0,0,0,,世上有各式各样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.36,1:05:51.35,CHS,640,0,0,0,,而你必须做个选择
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.11,1:06:11.67,CHS,641,0,0,0,,紧张大师  准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.21,1:06:14.15,CHS,642,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.27,1:06:40.50,CHS,643,0,0,0,,好车  市价是多少？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.58,1:06:44.01,CHS,644,0,0,0,,老兄  你可负担不起 这可是法拉利
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.88,1:06:50.82,CHS,645,0,0,0,,赢过他
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.04,1:07:50.53,CHS,646,0,0,0,,- 有什么事不对劲吗？ - 没什么  我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.61,1:07:54.45,CHS,647,0,0,0,,少装蒜了 显而易见的你有心事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.52,1:07:58.65,CHS,648,0,0,0,,我也和别人一样 心情有好有坏
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.25,1:08:02.69,CHS,649,0,0,0,,别失去你那股酷劲 那才是你的饭票
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.73,1:08:07.66,CHS,650,0,0,0,,我的饭票 我连自己的车都负担不起
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.73,1:08:11.19,CHS,651,0,0,0,,- 我已经替你改装了一部车 - 你看这就是我的毛病
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.27,1:08:14.10,CHS,652,0,0,0,,我不接受别人的施舍
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.17,1:08:15.97,CHS,653,0,0,0,,我要自己去赚
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.07,1:08:19.27,CHS,654,0,0,0,,我必须另外赚些外快 就像你一样
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.34,1:08:21.54,CHS,655,0,0,0,,像我一样  这是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.61,1:08:24.54,CHS,656,0,0,0,,- 你言下之意是什么？ - 那就是我的意思
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.61,1:08:27.55,CHS,657,0,0,0,,- 像我一样  你在说什么 - 别想…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.62,1:08:29.74,CHS,658,0,0,0,,我不是傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.82,1:08:33.88,CHS,659,0,0,0,,你改装车子所花的那些钱…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.96,1:08:37.41,CHS,660,0,0,0,,老实说你改装车子所花的钱
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.49,1:08:39.82,CHS,661,0,0,0,,光靠替人调整引擎 和卖杂货绝对不够
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.10,1:08:43.76,CHS,662,0,0,0,,不管你的副业是什么 我要参加一份
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.12,1:09:09.64,CHS,663,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？ - 你自己看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.72,1:09:12.28,CHS,664,0,0,0,,- 这是干什么？ - 那是地图
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.39,1:09:18.23,CHS,665,0,0,0,,到极速大赛场的地图 先看你的表现
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.46,1:09:21.56,CHS,666,0,0,0,,别的以后再谈
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.44,1:10:05.00,CHS,667,0,0,0,,(不准进入  基地关闭 美国政府资产)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.21,1:10:08.61,CHS,668,0,0,0,,- 兄弟  你好吗？ - 你好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.68,1:10:10.44,CHS,669,0,0,0,,欢迎参加极速大赛
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.51,1:10:12.78,CHS,670,0,0,0,,很好  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.77,1:10:36.36,CHS,671,0,0,0,,嘿  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.11,1:10:41.57,CHS,672,0,0,0,,美女  你应该到观众席上去 否则会被排气喷得满身都是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.65,1:10:45.58,CHS,673,0,0,0,,- 少贫嘴  有钱再说话 - 那咱们就赌你的美臀如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.28,1:10:48.48,CHS,674,0,0,0,,想找女人好莱坞大道上多得是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.55,1:10:52.11,CHS,675,0,0,0,,若想来一小段刺激赛 赌注是两千
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.19,1:10:54.75,CHS,676,0,0,0,,就在此时此地  你敢吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.66,1:10:58.92,CHS,677,0,0,0,,好  就这么决定
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.22,1:11:20.91,CHS,678,0,0,0,,又一个送财美人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.39,1:11:26.79,CHS,679,0,0,0,,让我看看你有什么本事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.86,1:11:28.69,CHS,680,0,0,0,,等会儿见
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.79,1:12:06.13,CHS,681,0,0,0,,布莱恩  怎么样？ 布莱恩  怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.20,1:12:09.26,CHS,682,0,0,0,,杰西  你怎么了？ 你手里拿着什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.33,1:12:12.17,CHS,683,0,0,0,,学你呀  这是车主证
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.24,1:12:14.83,CHS,684,0,0,0,,- 车主证？是那辆捷达车吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.91,1:12:17.43,CHS,685,0,0,0,,- 你不能拿你爸爸的车来赌 - 没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.51,1:12:22.67,CHS,686,0,0,0,,我一定会赢 那家伙开的是本田2000
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.75,1:12:26.91,CHS,687,0,0,0,,我赢的话 等我爸出狱后手上就会有点钱
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.98,1:12:28.75,CHS,688,0,0,0,,等他杀了你后  又得回牢里去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.82,1:12:30.98,CHS,689,0,0,0,,放心  我一定会赢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.60,1:12:42.33,CHS,690,0,0,0,,想像你得到胜利 杰西  一定要想像你得到胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.40,1:12:45.06,CHS,691,0,0,0,,- 这很重要  你一定要听我的话 - 你的对手是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.54,1:12:54.53,CHS,692,0,0,0,,别和他赌  我保证他绝对 投资了好几十万在那部车上
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.87,1:13:20.93,CHS,693,0,0,0,,小子你太早了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.45,1:13:29.94,CHS,694,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.01,1:13:31.78,CHS,695,0,0,0,,喔  天呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.79,1:13:44.73,CHS,696,0,0,0,,快来  我们有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.80,1:13:47.23,CHS,697,0,0,0,,- 什么事？ - 是杰西
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.23,1:13:51.29,CHS,698,0,0,0,,- 他要去哪里？ - 他刚拿车主证和强尼赛车
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.37,1:13:53.89,CHS,699,0,0,0,,真要命
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.45,1:14:08.35,CHS,700,0,0,0,,- 他到哪里去了？ - 他去洗车
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.42,1:14:10.58,CHS,701,0,0,0,,去把我的车子拿来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.26,1:14:15.52,CHS,702,0,0,0,,你的车？ 现在可不是在你的地盘上
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.59,1:14:17.69,CHS,703,0,0,0,,看清楚你在和谁说话
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.33,1:14:27.86,CHS,704,0,0,0,,霹雳小组突击我家 使我家族受辱
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.94,1:14:30.27,CHS,705,0,0,0,,那是因为有人出卖我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.04,1:14:33.17,CHS,706,0,0,0,,出卖我的人就是你！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.16,1:14:47.35,CHS,707,0,0,0,,放开他！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.07,1:15:00.90,CHS,708,0,0,0,,把他拉走  别打了！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.95,1:15:11.14,CHS,709,0,0,0,,唐  冷静点  咱们走
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.22,1:15:15.05,CHS,710,0,0,0,,我从没出卖过任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.59,1:15:55.86,CHS,711,0,0,0,,蜜雅！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.80,1:16:06.24,CHS,712,0,0,0,,- 求求你不要去 - 我这么做是为了我们俩
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.30,1:16:08.24,CHS,713,0,0,0,,胡说  是为了你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.31,1:16:11.07,CHS,714,0,0,0,,- 为什么你不让我去呢？ - 你为什么一定要去呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.07,1:16:13.13,CHS,715,0,0,0,,唐  求求你别去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.39,1:16:27.88,CHS,716,0,0,0,,- 蜜雅  怎么回事？ - 什么怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.96,1:16:30.52,CHS,717,0,0,0,,- 你知道我在说什么 - 不  我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.59,1:16:33.75,CHS,718,0,0,0,,难道每次唐开车走时 你都会眼眶红红的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.83,1:16:35.69,CHS,719,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么搞的嘛？ - 别装了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.76,1:16:37.82,CHS,720,0,0,0,,半夜三更你哥哥会去哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.90,1:16:39.42,CHS,721,0,0,0,,是不是和卡车有关 你说是不是？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.50,1:16:41.73,CHS,722,0,0,0,,什么卡车  你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.80,1:16:43.43,CHS,723,0,0,0,,烦死人了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.50,1:16:46.53,CHS,724,0,0,0,,- 又怎么了？ - 你听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.61,1:16:49.08,CHS,725,0,0,0,,蜜雅  我是个警察
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.14,1:16:51.34,CHS,726,0,0,0,,你在胡言乱语什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.18,1:16:55.17,CHS,727,0,0,0,,当我们第一次见面时 我就是卧底警探
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.05,1:16:58.48,CHS,728,0,0,0,,我真的是警探
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.02,1:17:05.19,CHS,729,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.83,1:17:09.96,CHS,730,0,0,0,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.47,1:17:13.66,CHS,731,0,0,0,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.74,1:17:16.20,CHS,732,0,0,0,,你听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.27,1:17:20.17,CHS,733,0,0,0,,我可以对天发誓 我对你的感情是真实的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.24,1:17:23.54,CHS,734,0,0,0,,你一定要相信我 但现在的问题是你哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.61,1:17:26.34,CHS,735,0,0,0,,你哥哥正要去做案 而我们的时间不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.41,1:17:29.08,CHS,736,0,0,0,,那些卡车司机 不会再束手就擒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.15,1:17:30.55,CHS,737,0,0,0,,也许今晚他们能得手
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.62,1:17:33.68,CHS,738,0,0,0,,但是加州所有的执法人员 都会盯上他们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.46,1:17:36.42,CHS,739,0,0,0,,如果你希望你哥哥、莱蒂 李昂、文斯都能安全无恙
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.42,1:17:39.29,CHS,740,0,0,0,,最好现在就和我一起走
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.36,1:17:41.29,CHS,741,0,0,0,,你一定要帮我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.13,1:17:45.53,CHS,742,0,0,0,,你是唯一能帮我的人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.23,1:17:49.53,CHS,743,0,0,0,,求求你帮助我
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.28,1:18:04.25,CHS,744,0,0,0,,本田车藏在 某处加热锅炉厂的外面
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.32,1:18:07.88,CHS,745,0,0,0,,他们是不开回头路的 而十号公路上又有警察在巡逻
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.96,1:18:09.05,CHS,746,0,0,0,,那我们得到什么结论
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.12,1:18:10.82,CHS,747,0,0,0,,这就是我们的结论
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.70,1:18:22.60,CHS,748,0,0,0,,- 手机服务 - 我是奥康纳警探
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.67,1:18:25.33,CHS,749,0,0,0,,编号是34762
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.41,1:18:27.27,CHS,750,0,0,0,,我需要追踪一个手机号码
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.34,1:18:30.21,CHS,751,0,0,0,,- 手机号码是什么？ - 蜜雅  手机号码呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.61,1:18:35.17,CHS,752,0,0,0,,她现在需要唐的手机号码
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.45,1:18:43.36,CHS,753,0,0,0,,323-555-6439
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.86,1:18:47.76,CHS,754,0,0,0,,谢谢你  你听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.69,1:19:17.06,CHS,755,0,0,0,,我们少了一个人 所以莱蒂你要开车
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.63,1:19:22.82,CHS,756,0,0,0,,你妹妹说的没错 似乎是有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.90,1:19:24.96,CHS,757,0,0,0,,别这么说
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.07,1:19:27.97,CHS,758,0,0,0,,- 真的好像有问题 - 别说了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.04,1:19:30.09,CHS,759,0,0,0,,我们应该等杰西的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.41,1:19:34.24,CHS,760,0,0,0,,这是个大金矿 我们已经盯了三个月
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.31,1:19:36.80,CHS,761,0,0,0,,做完这次  大家都可以放长假
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.88,1:19:39.31,CHS,762,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 希望如此
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.52,1:19:46.58,CHS,763,0,0,0,,有一天晚上我做了个梦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.65,1:19:49.18,CHS,764,0,0,0,,梦见我们俩在墨西哥的海滩上
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.26,1:19:50.82,CHS,765,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？ - 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.36,1:19:56.63,CHS,766,0,0,0,,走  先把这件事搞定
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.04,1:20:03.47,CHS,767,0,0,0,,- 注意扫瞄器 - 知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.34,1:20:09.28,CHS,768,0,0,0,,好  我们出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.42,1:20:20.35,CHS,769,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.42,1:20:23.12,CHS,770,0,0,0,,那个手机号码在86号公路北向
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.19,1:20:26.02,CHS,771,0,0,0,,在科切拉之外 英里程标114的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.09,1:20:28.72,CHS,772,0,0,0,,- 我们会继续追踪 - 我来看一下地图
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.54,1:20:37.23,CHS,773,0,0,0,,我们离他们大约40英里
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.31,1:20:39.07,CHS,774,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.11,1:20:42.44,CHS,775,0,0,0,,你到底想怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.41,1:21:16.50,CHS,776,0,0,0,,好  开始行动
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.19,1:21:34.25,CHS,777,0,0,0,,情况不错 扫瞄器上什么也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.33,1:21:35.59,CHS,778,0,0,0,,继续注意
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.35,1:21:54.25,CHS,779,0,0,0,,文斯  快回来！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.89,1:22:06.83,CHS,780,0,0,0,,- 司机居然有猎枪 - 退后  把他弄下来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.83,1:22:11.30,CHS,781,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.48,1:22:24.41,CHS,782,0,0,0,,把我弄下来  靠近点
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.75,1:22:28.31,CHS,783,0,0,0,,- 你先把钩子松开 - 回来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.38,1:22:30.61,CHS,784,0,0,0,,- 快松开 - 靠近点！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.69,1:22:32.29,CHS,785,0,0,0,,- 我不能… - 你能的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.29,1:22:33.95,CHS,786,0,0,0,,你一靠近我就跳
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.02,1:22:35.68,CHS,787,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.60,1:22:46.00,CHS,788,0,0,0,,我去分散他的注意力
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.04,1:22:55.63,CHS,789,0,0,0,,你们加油呀
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.71,1:22:57.34,CHS,790,0,0,0,,开枪哪有赛车刺激
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.78,1:23:04.98,CHS,791,0,0,0,,混蛋  你居然真开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.62,1:23:11.15,CHS,792,0,0,0,,帮我离开这里 我先把金属线松开
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.23,1:23:15.49,CHS,793,0,0,0,,再试一次  一、二、三
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.61,1:23:30.41,CHS,794,0,0,0,,先把线松开
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.48,1:23:34.24,CHS,795,0,0,0,,- 我的手臂被缠住了 - 你抓住我的手
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.32,1:23:36.68,CHS,796,0,0,0,,- 我的手臂！ - 听着  把你的手给我
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.75,1:23:38.84,CHS,797,0,0,0,,- 我的手被缠住了 - 我会拉你过来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.56,1:23:47.76,CHS,798,0,0,0,,唐老大  千万别放弃我
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.67,1:23:57.73,CHS,799,0,0,0,,要命！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.24,1:24:03.51,CHS,800,0,0,0,,坚持下去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.81,1:24:06.94,CHS,801,0,0,0,,你走开  我去帮他
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.31,1:24:36.77,CHS,802,0,0,0,,- 莱蒂！ - 李昂  你回去帮莱蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.84,1:24:39.75,CHS,803,0,0,0,,- 把她带走 - 我马上去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.52,1:24:50.72,CHS,804,0,0,0,,我去帮她  你把文斯救下来
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.00,1:24:59.97,CHS,805,0,0,0,,莱蒂
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.03,1:25:01.90,CHS,806,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.97,1:25:04.94,CHS,807,0,0,0,,你还好吗？让我看看
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.01,1:25:07.24,CHS,808,0,0,0,,快  我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.95,1:25:52.71,CHS,809,0,0,0,,- 你来开车 - 你是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.79,1:25:54.28,CHS,810,0,0,0,,把脚踩在油门上
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.36,1:25:56.19,CHS,811,0,0,0,,- 你想干什么？ - 我去救他
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.26,1:25:58.88,CHS,812,0,0,0,,- 快踩油门 - 好！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.86,1:26:05.83,CHS,813,0,0,0,,- 稳住车子 - 可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.07,1:26:09.23,CHS,814,0,0,0,,文斯  坚持下去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.30,1:26:12.64,CHS,815,0,0,0,,他的情况不好  再靠近点
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.71,1:26:13.64,CHS,816,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.84,1:26:17.21,CHS,817,0,0,0,,- 再靠进一点 - 我正在接近
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.28,1:26:19.64,CHS,818,0,0,0,,好  保持这个距离
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.88,1:26:25.55,CHS,819,0,0,0,,- 跳！ - 你要和我合作
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.62,1:26:27.81,CHS,820,0,0,0,,我们会把你弄下去 把你的手臂给我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.89,1:26:30.19,CHS,821,0,0,0,,看着我  千万别放手
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.19,1:26:36.69,CHS,822,0,0,0,,文斯  用手臂抱着我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.43,1:26:40.26,CHS,823,0,0,0,,别放手
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.94,1:26:45.60,CHS,824,0,0,0,,文斯！靠近点
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.55,1:26:53.57,CHS,825,0,0,0,,再靠近点
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.65,1:26:54.74,CHS,826,0,0,0,,好了  你先下去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.92,1:27:01.79,CHS,827,0,0,0,,我要跳了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.01,1:27:24.44,CHS,828,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.88,1:27:31.98,CHS,829,0,0,0,,宝贝  不会有问题的  我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.22,1:27:36.15,CHS,830,0,0,0,,你去照顾她
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.89,1:27:39.83,CHS,831,0,0,0,,文斯  撑下去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.53,1:27:46.56,CHS,832,0,0,0,,救护车得在十分钟内到达 否则他就死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.80,1:27:49.06,CHS,833,0,0,0,,- 你按着这里 - 我会的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.14,1:27:50.66,CHS,834,0,0,0,,别放手  把他的手臂抬高
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.41,1:28:00.01,CHS,835,0,0,0,,我是奥康纳警探
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.08,1:28:02.24,CHS,836,0,0,0,,现在不在职勤中
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.32,1:28:04.34,CHS,837,0,0,0,,我立刻需要一架救护直升机
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.02,1:28:09.68,CHS,838,0,0,0,,我的位置是在86号公路 英里程标147
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.76,1:28:16.53,CHS,839,0,0,0,,这里有一位重伤遇难者 大约24岁、六尺高、200磅
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.60,1:28:19.69,CHS,840,0,0,0,,右臂的割口很深、动脉出血
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.43,1:28:24.89,CHS,841,0,0,0,,他的左脚被猎枪近距离射伤
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.97,1:28:26.63,CHS,842,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.71,1:28:29.47,CHS,843,0,0,0,,他刚进入休克状态
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.71,1:30:11.41,CHS,844,0,0,0,,唐  把枪放下来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.01,1:30:16.45,CHS,845,0,0,0,,- 把你的车开走 - 放屁  把枪放下来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.52,1:30:19.31,CHS,846,0,0,0,,- 不要再逃了 - 我没有逃
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.16,1:30:24.72,CHS,847,0,0,0,,- 李昂和莱蒂呢？ - 他们早就走了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.79,1:30:27.99,CHS,848,0,0,0,,一切都结束了  我没叫警察 但别逼我
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.06,1:30:31.00,CHS,849,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下来  我发誓… - 你就是警察
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.06,1:30:32.62,CHS,850,0,0,0,,你就是警察呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.83,1:30:37.33,CHS,851,0,0,0,,我必须在他们之前找到杰西
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.40,1:30:40.37,CHS,852,0,0,0,,- 这孩子只能靠我 - 我可以叫警方寻找他的车牌
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.44,1:30:43.57,CHS,853,0,0,0,,一定会在强尼之前找到他的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.51,1:30:47.48,CHS,854,0,0,0,,- 把你的车开走 - 拜托你们别吵了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.55,1:30:51.24,CHS,855,0,0,0,,蜜雅  没你的事  把你的…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.36,1:31:00.35,CHS,856,0,0,0,,唐  对不起 我不知道自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.56,1:31:04.96,CHS,857,0,0,0,,我吓得要死  不知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.30,1:31:09.76,CHS,858,0,0,0,,- 杰西  你的脑袋在想些什么？ - 我吓呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.84,1:31:14.50,CHS,859,0,0,0,,我真不知道自己在干什么 求求你帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.93,1:31:43.67,CHS,860,0,0,0,,杰西！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.16,1:34:58.15,CHS,861,0,0,0,,叫救护车  你去叫救护车
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.17,1:35:36.53,CHS,862,0,0,0,,当我念高中时常来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.60,1:35:40.90,CHS,863,0,0,0,,从这里到平交道是四分之一英里
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.94,1:35:44.41,CHS,864,0,0,0,,绿灯一亮我就会冲过去
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.10,1:38:21.59,CHS,865,0,0,0,,我没料到会是这样的结果
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.91,1:39:09.85,CHS,866,0,0,0,,你知道自己在做什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.18,1:39:12.45,CHS,867,0,0,0,,我还欠你一部极速跑车
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.25,1:46:28.94,CHS,868,0,0,0,,我是今朝有酒今朝醉
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.58,1:46:32.35,CHS,869,0,0,0,,其他都无关紧要
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.42,1:46:35.98,CHS,870,0,0,0,,只有赛车时的短短十秒钟
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.82,1:46:38.15,CHS,871,0,0,0,,刹那间我彻底的解脱了